t-br.json":86,"./pt.json":87,"./ro.json":88,"./ru.json":89,"./sk.json":90,"./sl.json":91,"./sq.json":92,"./sr-me.json":93,"./sr.json":94,"./sv.json":95,"./th.json":96,"./tr.json":97,"./uk.json":98,"./ur.json":99,"./vi.json":100,"./zh-cn.json":101,"./zh-tw.json":102};function o(e){var n=s(e);return t(n)}function s(e){if(!t.o(a,e)){var n=new Error("Cannot find module '"+e+"'");throw n.code="MODULE_NOT_FOUND",n}return a[e]}o.keys=function(){return Object.keys(a)},o.resolve=s,e.exports=o,o.id=25},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":'### تثبيت التطبيق: \n\n1. سجل الدخول إلى حسابك في Zendesk Support، ثم انقر فوق أيقونة **الإدارة** في العمود الجانبي.\n2. حدد **تطبيقات** > **السوق**، ثم ابحث عن **تطبيق الإشعار** وانقر فوق العنوان.\n3. على صفحة تطبيق الإشعار، انقر فوق **تثبيت التطبيق** في الزاوية العلوية اليمنى.\n4. عند إتمام التثبيت، يمكنك إرسال رسائل مبثوثة لكل الوكلاء مسجلي الدخول.\n\n**ملاحظة:** مديرو Zendesk فقط هم الذين يمكنهم تمكين مجموعات مستخدمين أخرى للسماح لها بإرسال إشعارات.\n\n### استخدام التطبيق:\n\n1. عند تسجيل الدخول إلى Zendesk، وسِّع التطبيق الموجود في الشريط العلوي.\n2. أدخل الرسالة التي تريد بثها.\n3. حدد المجموعة التي تريد إرسال الرسالة إليها. إذا تركت المجموعة خالية، ستُرسل الرسالة إلى كل الوكلاء مسجلي الدخول.\n4. انقر فوق " البث" . ستؤدي رسالتك إلى انبثاق نافذة التطبيق لدى كل الوكلاء مسجلي الدخول.\n\nتدعم رسائل تطبيق الإشعار مجموعة فرعية من Markdown. للمزيد من المعلومات عن Markdown، راجع [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  كما يتم تلقائيًا استكشاف عناوين URL وتحويلها إلى روابط أو صور، لكن لا يزال بإمكانك استخدام Markdown إذا أردت. تطبيق Markdown مدعوم لكل مما يلي:\n\n* الروابط\n* الصور\n* غامق\n* مائل\n* عناوين المستوى 3\n',"app.long_description":'النقاط الأساسية:\n\n* سهولة إشعار مجموعة من الوكلاء الذين سجلوا الدخول إلى حسابك على Zendesk‏\n* مشاركة الصور أو الروابط أو غير ذلك من الموارد المفيدة أو الترفيهية\n* جعل الوكلاء يتعرفون على معلومات مهمة بشأن عملهم بشكل استباقي\n\nالشرح:\n\nيمكّن تطبيق الإشعارات مديري Zendesk من بث الرسائل إلى بعض وكلاء Zendesk التابعين لك أو كلهم. على سبيل المثال، لسرعة إعلام فريقك بحدوث انقطاع للخدمة أو دعوتهم إلى تناول الغداء.  ما عليك إلا فتح التطبيق وكتابة رسالة وتحديد المجموعة ثم انقر فوق "إرسال". سينبثق التطبيق ويعرض الرسائل إلى كل الوكلاء المسجلين الدخول في الوقت الحقيقي.  يُحفظ سجل الرسائل داخل التطبيق حتى يقوم الوكيل بالخروج من Zendesk‏.\n\nاستخدم تطبيق الإشعار لتظل الشركة محيطة بالمعلومات الحرجة في الوقت الحقيقي.\n\n![مثال لإشعار](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)‏\n\nبموجب تمكين هذا التطبيق، أنت توافق على [شروط استخدام Built by Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/‎).',"app.name":"تطبيق الإشعار","app.short_description":"أرسل رسالة إلى كل الوكلاء الذين سجلوا الدخول إلى حسابك على Zendesk","button.cancel":"إلغاء","button.save":"حفظ","button.sendMessage":"بث","button.toAdmin":"رسالة جديدة","label.groups":"المجموعات","label.message":"رسالة","label.sender_groups":"مجموعات المرسلين","label.sender_groups_helptext":"يسمح هذا الإعداد للمجموعات الأخرى بإرسال رسالة.","message.messagePlaceholder":"شارك رسالة مع وكلائك. ويُحبَّذ استخدام Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"شارك رسالة مع وكلائك. صيغة Markdown مدعومة.","message.placeholder2":"لم تصل أي رسائل.",you2:"(أنت)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Установка приложения:\n\n1. Войдите в Zendesk Support и щелкните значок **Администратор** на боковой панели.\n2. Выберите команды **Приложения ** > **Marketplace**, затем найдите приложение **Уведомление** и щелкните название.\n3. На странице приложения щелкните ссылку **Установить приложение** в правом верхнем углу.\n4. По окончании установки вы сможете транслировать сообщения своим агентам, присутствующим в системе.\n\n**Примечание.** Только администраторы Zendesk могут разрешать другим группам пользователей отправку уведомлений.\n\n### Использование приложения:\n\n1. После входа в Zendesk разверните приложение из верхнего меню.\n2. Введите сообщение, которое надо транслировать.\n3. Выберите группу, в которую оно должно быть отправлено. Если оставить поле группы пустым, сообщение будет отправлено всем агентам в системе.\n4. Нажмите кнопку «Транслировать». Ваше сообщение откроет приложение у всех агентов в системе.\n\nСообщения в приложении «Уведомление» поддерживают подмножество языка Markdown. Дополнительную информацию о Markdown можно получить здесь: [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Кроме того, URL-адреса автоматически распознаются и преобразуются в ссылки или изображения (но при желании можно использовать Markdown). Markdown поддерживается для следующих объектов:\n\n* ссылок\n* изображений\n* жирного шрифта\n* курсива\n* заголовков уровня 3\n","app.long_description":"Основные возможности:\n\n* удобное уведомление группы агентов или всех агентов, вошедших в ваш аккаунт Zendesk;\n* обмен изображениями, ссылками и другими интересными или забавными ресурсами;\n* заблаговременное доведение до агентов важной информации об их работе.\n\nОписание.\n\nПриложение «Уведомление» позволяет администраторам Zendesk транслировать сообщения некоторым или всем агентам. Например, с его помощью можно быстро известить своих сотрудников об отключении электричества или пригласить их на обед.  Просто откройте приложение, введите сообщение, выберите группу и нажмите кнопку «Отправить». Сообщение появится в реальном времени во всплывающем окне у всех агентов, которые присутствуют в системе.  История сообщений хранится в приложении, пока пользователь не выйдет из Zendesk.\n\nПриложение «Уведомление» позволяет всегда держать своих сотрудников в курсе всех событий.\n\n![Пример уведомления](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nАктивируя это приложение, вы принимаете [Условия пользования продуктами Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Приложение для уведомлений","app.short_description":"Распространяйте сообщения среди всех агентов, которые вошли в ваш аккаунт Zendesk","button.cancel":"Отмена","button.save":"Сохранить","button.sendMessage":"Распространить","button.toAdmin":"Новое сообщение","label.groups":"Группы","label.message":"Сообщение","label.sender_groups":"Группы-отправители","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Эта настройка позволяет отправлять сообщения из других групп.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Распространите сообщение среди ваших агентов. Рекомендуется применять Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Распространите сообщение среди ваших агентов. Поддерживается Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"Нет сообщений.",you2:"(вы)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Инсталиране на приложението:\n\n1. Влезте в акаунта си в Zendesk Support и кликнете върху иконата „Администратор“ в страничната лента.\n2. Изберете **Приложения** > **Магазин**, намерете **приложението „Уведомление“** и кликнете върху плочката.\n3. На страницата на приложението кликнете върху **„Инсталиране на приложението“** в горния десен ъгъл.\n4. След приключване на инсталирането можете да разпращате съобщения на консултантите, които са в системата.\n\n**Забележка:** Само администратори на Zendesk могат да разрешават на други потребителски групи да изпращат уведомления.\n\n### Използване на приложението:\n\n1. След влизане в Zendesk разширете приложението, намиращо се в горната лента.\n2. Въведете съобщението, което искате да разпратите.\n3. Изберете групата, до която желаете да го изпратите. Ако оставите полето за група празно, съобщението ще се изпрати до всички консултанти в системата.\n4. Кликнете върху „Разпращане“. Съобщението ви ще отвори приложението за всички консултанти, намиращи се в момента в системата.\n\nСъобщенията в приложението „Уведомление“ поддържат подмножество на Markdown. За повече информация относно Markdown вижте [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Освен това, URLs адресите автоматично се разпознават и преобразуват в линкове или изображения (но, ако предпочитате, можете да използвате Markdown). Markdown се поддържа за:\n\n* линкове\n* изображения\n* получер шрифт\n* курсив\n* заглавия ниво 3\n","app.long_description":"Основни предимства:\n\n* Лесно уведомяване на група консултанти или на всички консултанти, влезли във вашия Zendesk акаунт\n* Споделяне на снимки, линкове или други полезни или забавни ресурси\n* Активно уведомяване на консултантите за информация, важна за работата им\n\nОписание:\n\nПриложението „Уведомление“ дава възможност на администраторите на Zendesk да разпращат съобщения до някои или до всички ваши консултанти. Например, можете бързо да уведомите екипа си за прекъсване на електрозахранването – или пък да го поканите на обяд.  Просто отворете приложението, въведете съобщение, изберете група и кликнете върху „Изпращане“. Приложението ще покаже съобщението в изскачащ прозорец на всички намиращи се в системата консултанти, в реално време.  Историята на съобщенията се съхранява в приложението, докато консултантите излязат от Zendesk.\n\nИзползвайте приложението „Уведомление“, за да поддържате информираността на компанията в реално време.\n\n![Примерно уведомление](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nАктивирайки това приложение, вие приемате предвиденото в [Условия за ползване на приложения, създадени от Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Приложение „Уведомление“","app.short_description":"Разпращане на съобщение до всички консултанти, влезли във вашия Zendesk акаунт","button.cancel":"Отмяна","button.save":"Запазване","button.sendMessage":"Разпространяване","button.toAdmin":"Ново съобщение","label.groups":"Групи","label.message":"Съобщение","label.sender_groups":"Групи с възможност да изпращат","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Членовете на посочените групи могат да изпращат съобщения.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Споделете съобщение с консултантите си. Препоръчва се използването на Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Напишете съобщение на вашите консултанти. Текстът поддържа Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"Няма получени съобщения.",you2:"(вие)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Instalación de la aplicación:\n\n1. Inicie sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk Support y luego haga clic en el icono **Administrador** en la barra lateral.\n2. Seleccione **Aplicaciones** > **Marketplace**, busque la **Aplicación de notificaciones** y luego haga clic en el título.\n3. En la página de la Aplicación de notificaciones, haga clic en **Instalar aplicación** en la esquina superior derecha.\n4. Una vez finalizada la instalación, podrá difundir mensajes a los agentes que han iniciado sesión. \n\n**Nota:** Solo los administradores de Zendesk pueden permitir que otros grupos de usuarios puedan enviar notificaciones.\n\n### Uso de la aplicación:\n\n1. Después de iniciar sesión en Zendesk, amplíe la aplicación que se encuentra en la barra superior.\n2. Escriba el mensaje que desea difundir.\n3. Seleccione el grupo al cual desea enviarlo. Si se deja el grupo en blanco, se enviará a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n4. Haga clic en Difundir. El mensaje hará que se abra la aplicación para todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n\nLos mensajes de la Aplicación de notificaciones admiten un subconjunto de atributos de Markdown. Si desea más información sobre Markdown, consulte [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Los URL también son detectados automáticamente y se convierten en vínculos o imágenes, pero puede seguir usando Markdown si desea. Markdown es compatible con lo siguiente:\n\n* Vínculos\n* Imágenes\n* Negrita\n* Cursiva\n* Encabezados de tercer nivel\n","app.long_description":"Puntos clave: \n\n* Envíe notificaciones fácilmente a un grupo de agentes o a todos los agentes que hayan iniciado sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk\n* Comparta imágenes, vínculos y otros recursos útiles y divertidos\n* Comparta información importante y de manera proactiva con los agentes sobre el trabajo que están realizando\n\nDescripción:\n\nLa Aplicación de notificaciones permite que los administradores de Zendesk difundan mensajes a algunos o a todos los agentes. Por ejemplo, informe rápidamente a su equipo sobre un apagado total o invítelos fácilmente a salir a almorzar.  Lo único que hay que hacer es abrir la aplicación, escribir un mensaje, seleccionar el grupo y hacer clic para enviar. La aplicación se abrirá automáticamente y mostrará los mensajes en tiempo real a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.  El historial de mensajes se almacena en la aplicación hasta que el agente cierre sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk.\n\nUtilice la Aplicación de notificaciones para mantener a la compañía al tanto de información crítica en tiempo real.\n\n![Notificación de ejemplo](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAl activar esta aplicación, usted acepta los [Términos de uso de Creadas por Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplicación de notificaciones","app.short_description":"Difunda un mensaje a todos los agentes que inicien sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk","button.cancel":"Cancelar","button.save":"Guardar","button.sendMessage":"Difundir","button.toAdmin":"Nuevo mensaje","label.groups":"Grupos","label.message":"Mensaje","label.sender_groups":"Grupos remitentes","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Esta configuración permite que otros grupos envíen mensajes.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Comparta un mensaje con sus agentes. Se recomienda el uso de Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Comparta un mensaje con los agentes. Se puede usar Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"No se ha recibido ningún mensaje.",you2:"(usted)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Instalace aplikace:\r\n\r\n1. Přihlaste se do svého Zendesk Supportu a klikněte na ikonu administrátora v postranním panelu.\r\n2. Vyberte **Aplikace** > **Marketplace**, pak najděte aplikaci **Oznámení** a klikněte na její název.\r\n3. V pravém horním rohu stránky aplikace Oznámení klikněte na **Nainstalovat aplikaci**.\r\n4. Po dokončení instalace můžete posílat zprávy přihlášeným agentům.\r\n\r\n**Poznámka:** Pouze administrátoři Zendesku mohou nastavit ostatním skupinám uživatelů povolení posílat oznámení.\r\n\r\n### Používání aplikace:\r\n\r\n1. Když jste přihlášeni do Zendesku, rozbalte aplikaci umístěnou v horním panelu.\r\n2. Zadejte zprávu, kterou chcete poslat.\r\n3. Vyberte skupinu, které chcete zprávu poslat. Pokud necháte pole skupiny prázdné, pošle se zpráva všem přihlášeným agentům.\r\n4. Klikněte na Rozeslat. Vaše zpráva otevře aplikaci všem přihlášeným agentům.\r\n\r\nZprávy v aplikaci Oznámení podporují podmnožinu značkovacího jazyka Markdown. Další informace o jazyku Markdown viz [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Také se automaticky najdou adresy URL a změní se na odkazy nebo obrázky, ale přesto můžete použít jazyk Markdown, pokud chcete. Jazyk Markdown je podporován pro:\r\n\r\n* odkazy\r\n* obrázky\r\n* tučné písmo\r\n* kurzívu\r\n* nadpisy 3 úrovní\r\n","app.long_description":"Klíčové body:\n\n* Snadné zaslání oznámení skupině agentů nebo všem agentům přihlášeným ve vašem účtu Zendesku\n* Sdílení obrázků, odkazů a dalších užitečných nebo zábavných informací\n* Aktivní upozorňování agentů na důležité informace o jejich práci\n\nPopis:\n\nAplikace Oznámení umožňuje administrátorům Zendesku posílat zprávy některým nebo všem vašim agentům. Můžete například rychle upozornit svůj tým na výpadky nebo je snadno pozvat na oběd.  Jednoduše otevřete aplikaci, napište zprávu, vyberte skupinu a klikněte na Poslat. Aplikace se všem přihlášeným agentům v reálném čase rozbalí a zobrazí zprávy.  Historie zpráv je uložena v aplikaci, dokud se ze Zendesku neodhlásí.\n\nDíky aplikaci Oznámení budou uživatelé v celá vaší společnosti dostávat klíčové informace v reálném čase.\n\n![Příklad oznámení](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nTím, že zapnete tuto aplikaci, souhlasíte s [Podmínkami používání aplikací vytvořených společností Zendesk] (https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"aplikace Oznámení","app.short_description":"Poslat zprávu všem agentům připojeným k vašemu účtu Zendesku","button.cancel":"Zrušit","button.save":"Uložit","button.sendMessage":"Rozeslat","button.toAdmin":"Nová zpráva","label.groups":"Skupiny","label.message":"Zpráva","label.sender_groups":"Skupiny odesílatelů","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Toto nastavení umožní ostatním skupinám posílat zprávy.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Pošlete zprávu svým agentům. Doporučujeme používat jazyk Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Pošlete zprávu svým agentům. Můžete použít jazyk Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"Žádné přijaté zprávy.",you2:"(vy)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installerer appen:\n\n1. Log ind på din Zendesk Support-konto, og klik derefter på **Admin-ikonet** på sidepanelet. \n2. Vælg **Apps** > **Markedsplads**, find derefter **Notifikationsapp** og klik på titlen.\n3. Klik på **Installer app** i det øverste højre hjørne på siden for Notifikationsapp.\n4. Når installationen er færdig, kan du med det samme udsende meddelelser til dine agenter, som er logget ind.\n\n**Bemærk:** Det er kun Zendesk-administratorer, som kan give andre brugergrupper tilladelse til at sende notifikationer.\n\n### Brug af appen:\n\n1. Når du er logget ind på Zendesk, udvider du den app, som findes på det øverste panel.\n2. Indtast den besked, som du ønsker at udsende.\n3. Vælg den gruppe, som du ønsker at sende den til. Hvis du lader gruppen være tom, vil den blive sendt til alle agenter, som er logget ind.\n4. Klik på Udsend. Din besked vil åbne appen for alle agenter, som er logget ind.\n\nMeddelelser i Notifikationsapp understøtter et undersæt af Markdown. Du kan få yderligere oplysninger om Markdown på [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URL-adresser registreres også automatisk og forandres til links eller billeder, men du kan stadig bruge Markdown, hvis du vil. Markdown understøttes til følgende:\n\n* links\n* billeder\n* fed\n* kursiv\n* niveau 3 overskrifter\n","app.long_description":"Hovedpunkter:\n\n* Underret nemt en gruppe agenter eller alle de agenter, som er logget ind på din Zendesk-konto\n* Del billeder, links eller andre praktiske eller sjove ressourcer\n* Hold på proaktiv vis agenter underrettet om vigtige oplysninger vedr. deres arbejde\n\nBeskrivelse:\n\nMed Notifikationsapp er det muligt for Zendesk-administratorer at udsende meddelelser til nogle af eller alle dine agenter. Du kan f.eks. hurtigt informere dit team om et driftsstop eller nemt invitere teamet til frokost.  Åbn ganske enkelt appen, indtast en besked, vælg gruppen og klik på Send. Appen bliver åbnet og viser meddelelser til alle agenter, som er logget ind, i realtid.  Meddelelseshistorik lagres i appen, indtil agenten logger ud af Zendesk.\n\nBrug Notifikationsappen til at holde firmaet underrettet om kritiske oplysninger i realtid.\n\n![Eksempel på notifikation](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nNår du aktiverer denne app accepterer du [Brugsbetingelser for Bygget af Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notifikationsapp","app.short_description":"Udsend en besked til alle de agenter, som er logget ind på din Zendesk-konto","button.cancel":"Annuller","button.save":"Gem","button.sendMessage":"Udsend","button.toAdmin":"Ny meddelelse","label.groups":"Grupper","label.message":"Meddelelse","label.sender_groups":"Afsendergrupper","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Denne indstilling gør det muligt for andre grupper at sende en meddelelse.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Del en meddelelse med dine agenter. Markdown anbefales.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Del en meddelelse med dine agenter. Markdown understøttes.","message.placeholder2":"Der er ikke modtaget nogen meddelelser.",you2:"(dig)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installation der App:\n\n1. Melden Sie sich bei Ihrem Zendesk Support-Konto an und klicken Sie in der Seitenleiste auf das ** Admin**-Symbol.\n2. Klicken Sie auf ** Apps **> ** Marketplace**, machen Sie die App **Benachrichtigung** ausfindig und klicken Sie auf den Titel.\n3. Klicken Sie oben rechts auf der Seite für die App „Benachrichtigung“ auf **App installieren**.\n4. Nach Abschluss der Installation können Sie Nachrichten an alle angemeldeten Agenten senden.\n\n**Hinweis:**Nur Zendesk-Administratoren können anderen Benutzergruppen die Möglichkeit geben, Benachrichtigungen zu senden.### Verwendung der App:1. Stellen Sie sicher, dass Sie bei Zendesk angemeldet sind, und erweitern Sie die App in der oberen Leiste.\n2. Geben Sie die Nachricht ein, die Sie senden möchten.\n3. Wählen Sie die Gruppe aus, an die die Nachricht gesendet werden soll. Wenn Sie keine Gruppe auswählen, wird die Nachricht an alle angemeldete Agenten gesendet.\n4. Klicken Sie auf „Senden“. In der Benutzeroberfläche der angemeldeten Agenten wird die App geöffnet, damit sie die Nachricht sofort sehen.\n\nIn den Nachrichten, die Sie über die App „Benachrichtigung“ senden, können Sie bestimmte Markdown-Formatierungen verwenden. Weitere Informationen zu Markdown finden Sie unter [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs werden automatisch erkannt und in Links oder Bilder umgewandelt (Sie können aber nach wie vor Markdown verwenden, wenn Sie möchten). Markdown wird für folgende Elemente unterstützt:\n\n* Links\n* Bilder\n* Fettschrift\n* Kursivschrift\n* Überschriften der Ebene 3\n","app.long_description":"Wichtigste Funktionen:\n\n*Schnell und einfach eine Gruppe von Agenten oder alle bei Ihrem Zendesk-Konto angemeldeten Agenten benachrichtigen*Bilder, Links und andere nützliche Ressourcen mit allen teilen*Agenten proaktiv Informationen bereitstellen, die für ihre Arbeit wichtig sindBeschreibung:Mit der App „Benachrichtigung“ können Zendesk-Administratoren Nachrichten an einige oder alle Agenten senden, z. B. das Team über einen Systemausfall informieren oder es zum Mittagessen einladen.  Einfach die App öffnen, eine Nachricht eingeben, die Gruppe auswählen und auf „An alle senden“ klicken! In der Benutzeroberfläche der angemeldeten Agenten wird die App in Echtzeit geöffnet, damit sie die Nachricht sofort sehen.  Der Nachrichtenverlauf bleibt bis zur Abmeldung von Zendesk in der App gespeichert.\n\nMit der App „Benachrichtigung“ können Sie Ihre Kollegen in Echtzeit auf dem Laufenden halten.![Beispiel für eine Benachrichtigung](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)Durch Aktivierung dieser App akzeptieren Sie die [Nutzungsbedingungen für von Zendesk erstellte Apps](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"App „Agentenbenachrichtigung“","app.short_description":"Nachricht an alle Agenten senden, die bei Ihrem Zendesk Support-Konto angemeldet sind","button.cancel":"Abbrechen","button.save":"Speichern","button.sendMessage":"An alle senden","button.toAdmin":"Neue Nachricht","label.groups":"Gruppen","label.message":"Nachricht","label.sender_groups":"Absendergruppen","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Diese Einstellung ermöglicht es anderen Gruppen, Nachrichten zu senden.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Nachricht an alle Ihre Agenten senden. Markdown wird empfohlen.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Nachricht an alle Ihre Agenten. Markdown wird unterstützt.","message.placeholder2":"Keine Nachrichten empfangen",you2:"(Sie)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":'### Εγκατάσταση της εφαρμογής:\n\n1. Εισέλθετε στον λογαριασμό σας Zendesk Support και, στη συνέχεια, κάντε κλικ στο εικονίδιο **Διαχειριστής** στην πλευρική εργαλειοθήκη.\n2. Επιλέξτε **Εφαρμογές** > **Marketplace** και, στη συνέχεια, βρείτε την **Εφαρμογή ειδοποιήσεων** και κάντε κλικ στον τίτλο.\n3. Στη σελίδα της εφαρμογής ειδοποιήσεων, κάντε κλικ στην επιλογή **Εγκατάσταση εφαρμογής** στην επάνω δεξιά γωνία.\n.4 Όταν ολοκληρωθεί η εγκατάσταση, μπορείτε να μεταδώσετε μηνύματα στους συνδεδεμένους εκπροσώπους σας.\n\n**Σημείωση:** Μόνο οι διαχειριστές Zendesk μπορούν να επιτρέψουν σε άλλες ομάδες χρηστών να στέλνουν ειδοποιήσεις.\n\n### Χρήση της εφαρμογής:\n\n1. Όταν πραγματοποιήσετε είσοδο στο Zendesk, αναπτύξτε την εφαρμογή που βρίσκεται στην επάνω γραμμή.\n2. Πληκτρολογήστε το μήνυμα που θέλετε να μεταδώσετε.\n3. Επιλέξτε την ομάδα στην οποία θέλετε να το στείλετε. Αν αφήσετε την ομάδα κενή, το μήνυμα θα σταλεί σε όλους τους συνδεδεμένους εκπροσώπους.\n4. Επιλέξτε " Μετάδοση" . Το μήνυμά σας θα ανοίξει την εφαρμογή για όλους τους συνδεδεμένους εκπροσώπους.\n\nΤα μηνύματα στην εφαρμογή ειδοποιήσεων υποστηρίζουν ένα υποσύνολο Markdown. Για περισσότερες πληροφορίες σχετικά με το Markdown, ανατρέξτε στο θέμα [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Τα URL ανιχνεύονται αυτόματα και μετατρέπονται σε συνδέσμους ή εικόνες, αλλά εξακολουθείτε να μπορείτε να χρησιμοποιήσετε το Markdown, αν θέλετε. Το Markdown υποστηρίζεται για τα παρακάτω:\n\n* Σύνδεσμοι\n* Εικόνες\n* Έντονη γραφή\n* Πλάγια γραφή\n* Κεφαλίδες επιπέδου 3\n',"app.long_description":'Βασικά σημεία:\n\n* Ειδοποιήστε εύκολα μια ομάδα εκπροσώπων ή όλους τους εκπροσώπους που έχουν εισέλθει στον λογαριασμό Zendesk σας\n* Μοιραστείτε εικόνες, συνδέσμους ή άλλους χρήσιμους ή διασκεδαστικούς πόρους\n* Γνωστοποιήστε δυναμικά στους εκπροσώπους σημαντικές πληροφορίες σχετικά με την εργασία τους\n\nΠεριγραφή:\n\nΗ εφαρμογή ειδοποιήσεων επιτρέπει στους διαχειριστές του Zendesk να μεταδίδουν μηνύματα σε ορισμένους ή όλους τους εκπροσώπους σας. Για παράδειγμα, μπορείτε να ενημερώσετε γρήγορα την ομάδα σας για μια διακοπή ή μπορείτε να την προσκαλέσετε εύκολα για ένα γεύμα.  Απλώς, ανοίξτε την εφαρμογή, εισαγάγετε ένα μήνυμα, επιλέξτε την ομάδα και κάντε κλικ στο κουμπί "Αποστολή". Η εφαρμογή θα ανοίξει και θα εμφανίσει μηνύματα σε πραγματικό χρόνο σε όλους τους συνδεδεμένους εκπροσώπους.  Το ιστορικό μηνυμάτων αποθηκεύεται στην εφαρμογή έως ότου εξέλθουν από το Zendesk.\n\nΧρησιμοποιήστε την εφαρμογή ειδοποιήσεων για να διατηρήσετε την εταιρεία ενημερωμένη με κρίσιμες πληροφορίες, σε πραγματικό χρόνο.\n\n![Παράδειγμα ειδοποίησης](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nΜε την ενεργοποίηση αυτής της εφαρμογής, αποδέχεστε τους [Όρους χρήσης της Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).',"app.name":"Εφαρμογή ειδοποιήσεων","app.short_description":"Μεταδώστε ένα μήνυμα σε όλους τους εκπροσώπους που είναι συνδεδεμένοι στο λογαριασμό σας Zendesk","button.cancel":"Άκυρο","button.save":"Αποθήκευση","button.sendMessage":"Μετάδοση","button.toAdmin":"Νέο μήνυμα","label.groups":"Ομάδες","label.message":"Μήνυμα","label.sender_groups":"Ομάδες αποστολής","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Αυτή η επιλογή επιτρέπει σε άλλες ομάδες να κάνουν αποστολής ενός μηνύματος.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Κοινοποιήστε ένα μήνυμα στους εκπροσώπους σας. Συνιστάται η χρήση του Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Κοινοποιήστε ένα μήνυμα στους εκπροσώπους σας. Το Markdown υποστηρίζεται.","message.placeholder2":"Δεν έχουν ληφθεί μηνύματα.",you2:"(εσείς)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you’d like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings\n","app.long_description":"Key points:\n\n* Easily notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch.  Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time.  Messages history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you’d like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings\n","app.long_description":"Key points:\n\n* Easily notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch.  Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time.  Messages history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you’d like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings\n","app.long_description":"Key points:\n\n* Easily notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch.  Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time.  Messages history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you’d like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings\n","app.long_description":"Key points:\n\n* Easily notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch.  Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time.  Messages history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you’d like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings\n","app.long_description":"Key points:\n\n* Easily notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch.  Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time.  Messages history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you’d like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings\n","app.long_description":"Key points:\n\n* Easily notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch.  Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time.  Messages history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you’d like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings\n","app.long_description":"Key points:\n\n* Easily notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch.  Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time.  Messages history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.message":"Message","label.groups":"Groups","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)","button.save":"Save"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Instalación de la aplicación:\n\n1. Inicie sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk Support y luego haga clic en el icono **Administrador** en la barra lateral.\n2. Seleccione **Aplicaciones** > **Marketplace**, busque la **Aplicación de notificaciones** y luego haga clic en el título.\n3. En la página de la Aplicación de notificaciones, haga clic en **Instalar aplicación** en la esquina superior derecha.\n4. Una vez finalizada la instalación, podrá difundir mensajes a los agentes que han iniciado sesión. \n\n**Nota:** Solo los administradores de Zendesk pueden permitir que otros grupos de usuarios puedan enviar notificaciones.\n\n### Uso de la aplicación:\n\n1. Después de iniciar sesión en Zendesk, amplíe la aplicación que se encuentra en la barra superior.\n2. Escriba el mensaje que desea difundir.\n3. Seleccione el grupo al cual desea enviarlo. Si se deja el grupo en blanco, se enviará a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n4. Haga clic en Difundir. El mensaje hará que se abra la aplicación para todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n\nLos mensajes de la Aplicación de notificaciones admiten un subconjunto de atributos de Markdown. Si desea más información sobre Markdown, consulte [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Los URL también son detectados automáticamente y se convierten en vínculos o imágenes, pero puede seguir usando Markdown si desea. Markdown es compatible con lo siguiente:\n\n* Vínculos\n* Imágenes\n* Negrita\n* Cursiva\n* Encabezados de tercer nivel\n","app.long_description":"Puntos clave: \n\n* Envíe notificaciones fácilmente a un grupo de agentes o a todos los agentes que hayan iniciado sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk\n* Comparta imágenes, vínculos y otros recursos útiles y divertidos\n* Comparta información importante y de manera proactiva con los agentes sobre el trabajo que están realizando\n\nDescripción:\n\nLa Aplicación de notificaciones permite que los administradores de Zendesk difundan mensajes a algunos o a todos los agentes. Por ejemplo, informe rápidamente a su equipo sobre un apagado total o invítelos fácilmente a salir a almorzar.  Lo único que hay que hacer es abrir la aplicación, escribir un mensaje, seleccionar el grupo y hacer clic para enviar. La aplicación se abrirá automáticamente y mostrará los mensajes en tiempo real a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.  El historial de mensajes se almacena en la aplicación hasta que el agente cierre sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk.\n\nUtilice la Aplicación de notificaciones para mantener a la compañía al tanto de información crítica en tiempo real.\n\n![Notificación de ejemplo](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAl activar esta aplicación, usted acepta los [Términos de uso de Creadas por Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplicación de notificaciones","app.short_description":"Difunda un mensaje a todos los agentes que inicien sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk","button.cancel":"Cancelar","button.save":"Guardar","button.sendMessage":"Difundir","button.toAdmin":"Nuevo mensaje","label.groups":"Grupos","label.message":"Mensaje","label.sender_groups":"Grupos remitentes","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Esta configuración permite que otros grupos envíen mensajes.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Comparta un mensaje con sus agentes. Se recomienda el uso de Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Comparta un mensaje con los agentes. Se puede usar Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"No se ha recibido ningún mensaje.",you2:"(usted)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Instalación de la aplicación:\n\n1. Inicie sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk Support y luego haga clic en el icono **Administrador** en la barra lateral.\n2. Seleccione **Aplicaciones** > **Marketplace**, busque la **Aplicación de notificaciones** y luego haga clic en el título.\n3. En la página de la Aplicación de notificaciones, haga clic en **Instalar aplicación** en la esquina superior derecha.\n4. Una vez finalizada la instalación, podrá difundir mensajes a los agentes que han iniciado sesión. \n\n**Nota:** Solo los administradores de Zendesk pueden permitir que otros grupos de usuarios puedan enviar notificaciones.\n\n### Uso de la aplicación:\n\n1. Después de iniciar sesión en Zendesk, amplíe la aplicación que se encuentra en la barra superior.\n2. Escriba el mensaje que desea difundir.\n3. Seleccione el grupo al cual desea enviarlo. Si se deja el grupo en blanco, se enviará a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n4. Haga clic en Difundir. El mensaje hará que se abra la aplicación para todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n\nLos mensajes de la Aplicación de notificaciones admiten un subconjunto de atributos de Markdown. Si desea más información sobre Markdown, consulte [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Los URL también son detectados automáticamente y se convierten en vínculos o imágenes, pero puede seguir usando Markdown si desea. Markdown es compatible con lo siguiente:\n\n* Vínculos\n* Imágenes\n* Negrita\n* Cursiva\n* Encabezados de tercer nivel\n","app.long_description":"Puntos clave: \n\n* Envíe notificaciones fácilmente a un grupo de agentes o a todos los agentes que hayan iniciado sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk\n* Comparta imágenes, vínculos y otros recursos útiles y divertidos\n* Comparta información importante y de manera proactiva con los agentes sobre el trabajo que están realizando\n\nDescripción:\n\nLa Aplicación de notificaciones permite que los administradores de Zendesk difundan mensajes a algunos o a todos los agentes. Por ejemplo, informe rápidamente a su equipo sobre un apagado total o invítelos fácilmente a salir a almorzar.  Lo único que hay que hacer es abrir la aplicación, escribir un mensaje, seleccionar el grupo y hacer clic para enviar. La aplicación se abrirá automáticamente y mostrará los mensajes en tiempo real a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.  El historial de mensajes se almacena en la aplicación hasta que el agente cierre sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk.\n\nUtilice la Aplicación de notificaciones para mantener a la compañía al tanto de información crítica en tiempo real.\n\n![Notificación de ejemplo](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAl activar esta aplicación, usted acepta los [Términos de uso de Creadas por Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplicación de notificaciones","app.short_description":"Difunda un mensaje a todos los agentes que inicien sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk","button.cancel":"Cancelar","button.save":"Guardar","button.sendMessage":"Difundir","button.toAdmin":"Nuevo mensaje","label.groups":"Grupos","label.message":"Mensaje","label.sender_groups":"Grupos remitentes","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Esta configuración permite que otros grupos envíen mensajes.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Comparta un mensaje con sus agentes. Se recomienda el uso de Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Comparta un mensaje con los agentes. Se puede usar Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"No se ha recibido ningún mensaje.",you2:"(usted)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Instalación de la aplicación:\n\n1. Inicie sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk Support y luego haga clic en el icono **Administrador** en la barra lateral.\n2. Seleccione **Aplicaciones** > **Marketplace**, busque la **Aplicación de notificaciones** y luego haga clic en el título.\n3. En la página de la Aplicación de notificaciones, haga clic en **Instalar aplicación** en la esquina superior derecha.\n4. Una vez finalizada la instalación, podrá difundir mensajes a los agentes que han iniciado sesión. \n\n**Nota:** Solo los administradores de Zendesk pueden permitir que otros grupos de usuarios puedan enviar notificaciones.\n\n### Uso de la aplicación:\n\n1. Después de iniciar sesión en Zendesk, amplíe la aplicación que se encuentra en la barra superior.\n2. Escriba el mensaje que desea difundir.\n3. Seleccione el grupo al cual desea enviarlo. Si se deja el grupo en blanco, se enviará a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n4. Haga clic en Difundir. El mensaje hará que se abra la aplicación para todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n\nLos mensajes de la Aplicación de notificaciones admiten un subconjunto de atributos de Markdown. Si desea más información sobre Markdown, consulte [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Los URL también son detectados automáticamente y se convierten en vínculos o imágenes, pero puede seguir usando Markdown si desea. Markdown es compatible con lo siguiente:\n\n* Vínculos\n* Imágenes\n* Negrita\n* Cursiva\n* Encabezados de tercer nivel\n","app.long_description":"Puntos clave: \n\n* Envíe notificaciones fácilmente a un grupo de agentes o a todos los agentes que hayan iniciado sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk\n* Comparta imágenes, vínculos y otros recursos útiles y divertidos\n* Comparta información importante y de manera proactiva con los agentes sobre el trabajo que están realizando\n\nDescripción:\n\nLa Aplicación de notificaciones permite que los administradores de Zendesk difundan mensajes a algunos o a todos los agentes. Por ejemplo, informe rápidamente a su equipo sobre un apagado total o invítelos fácilmente a salir a almorzar.  Lo único que hay que hacer es abrir la aplicación, escribir un mensaje, seleccionar el grupo y hacer clic para enviar. La aplicación se abrirá automáticamente y mostrará los mensajes en tiempo real a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.  El historial de mensajes se almacena en la aplicación hasta que el agente cierre sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk.\n\nUtilice la Aplicación de notificaciones para mantener a la compañía al tanto de información crítica en tiempo real.\n\n![Notificación de ejemplo](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAl activar esta aplicación, usted acepta los [Términos de uso de Creadas por Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplicación de notificaciones","app.short_description":"Difunda un mensaje a todos los agentes que inicien sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk","button.cancel":"Cancelar","button.save":"Guardar","button.sendMessage":"Difundir","button.toAdmin":"Nuevo mensaje","label.groups":"Grupos","label.message":"Mensaje","label.sender_groups":"Grupos remitentes","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Esta configuración permite que otros grupos envíen mensajes.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Comparta un mensaje con sus agentes. Se recomienda el uso de Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Comparta un mensaje con los agentes. Se puede usar Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"No se ha recibido ningún mensaje.",you2:"(usted)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Instalación de la aplicación:\n\n1. Inicie sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk Support y luego haga clic en el icono **Administrador** en la barra lateral.\n2. Seleccione **Aplicaciones** > **Marketplace**, busque la **Aplicación de notificaciones** y luego haga clic en el título.\n3. En la página de la Aplicación de notificaciones, haga clic en **Instalar aplicación** en la esquina superior derecha.\n4. Una vez finalizada la instalación, podrá difundir mensajes a los agentes que han iniciado sesión. \n\n**Nota:** Solo los administradores de Zendesk pueden permitir que otros grupos de usuarios puedan enviar notificaciones.\n\n### Uso de la aplicación:\n\n1. Después de iniciar sesión en Zendesk, amplíe la aplicación que se encuentra en la barra superior.\n2. Escriba el mensaje que desea difundir.\n3. Seleccione el grupo al cual desea enviarlo. Si se deja el grupo en blanco, se enviará a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n4. Haga clic en Difundir. El mensaje hará que se abra la aplicación para todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.\n\nLos mensajes de la Aplicación de notificaciones admiten un subconjunto de atributos de Markdown. Si desea más información sobre Markdown, consulte [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Los URL también son detectados automáticamente y se convierten en vínculos o imágenes, pero puede seguir usando Markdown si desea. Markdown es compatible con lo siguiente:\n\n* Vínculos\n* Imágenes\n* Negrita\n* Cursiva\n* Encabezados de tercer nivel\n","app.long_description":"Puntos clave: \n\n* Envíe notificaciones fácilmente a un grupo de agentes o a todos los agentes que hayan iniciado sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk\n* Comparta imágenes, vínculos y otros recursos útiles y divertidos\n* Comparta información importante y de manera proactiva con los agentes sobre el trabajo que están realizando\n\nDescripción:\n\nLa Aplicación de notificaciones permite que los administradores de Zendesk difundan mensajes a algunos o a todos los agentes. Por ejemplo, informe rápidamente a su equipo sobre un apagado total o invítelos fácilmente a salir a almorzar.  Lo único que hay que hacer es abrir la aplicación, escribir un mensaje, seleccionar el grupo y hacer clic para enviar. La aplicación se abrirá automáticamente y mostrará los mensajes en tiempo real a todos los agentes que han iniciado sesión.  El historial de mensajes se almacena en la aplicación hasta que el agente cierre sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk.\n\nUtilice la Aplicación de notificaciones para mantener a la compañía al tanto de información crítica en tiempo real.\n\n![Notificación de ejemplo](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAl activar esta aplicación, usted acepta los [Términos de uso de Creadas por Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplicación de notificaciones","app.short_description":"Difunda un mensaje a todos los agentes que inicien sesión en su cuenta de Zendesk","button.cancel":"Cancelar","button.save":"Guardar","button.sendMessage":"Difundir","button.toAdmin":"Nuevo mensaje","label.groups":"Grupos","label.message":"Mensaje","label.sender_groups":"Grupos remitentes","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Esta configuración permite que otros grupos envíen mensajes.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Comparta un mensaje con sus agentes. Se recomienda el uso de Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Comparta un mensaje con los agentes. Se puede usar Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"No se ha recibido ningún mensaje.",you2:"(usted)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Sovelluksen asentaminen:\n\n1. Kirjaudu sisään Zendesk Supportiin ja napsauta sitten sivupalkin **Järjestelmänvalvoja**-kuvaketta.\n2. Valitse **Sovellukset** > **Sovelluskauppa**, etsi sitten **Ilmoitussovellus** ja napsauta otsikkoa.\n3. Napsauta Ilmoitussovellus-sivun oikeassa yläkulmassa **Asenna sovellus**.\n4. Kun asennus on valmis, voit lähettää viestejä sisäänkirjautuneille tukihenkilöille.\n\n**Huomautus:** Vain Zendesk-järjestelmänvalvojat voivat antaa muille käyttäjäryhmille mahdollisuuden lähettää ilmoituksia.\n\n### Sovelluksen käyttäminen:\n\n1. Kun olet kirjautunut sisään Zendeskiin, laajenna yläpalkissa sijaitseva sovellus.\n2. Kirjoita viesti, jonka haluat lähettää.\n3. Valitse ryhmä, jolle haluat lähettää sen. Jos jätät ryhmän tyhjäksi, viesti lähetetään kaikille sisäänkirjautuneille tukihenkilöille.\n4. Napsauta Massalähetys. Viestisi avaa sovelluksen kaikille sisäänkirjautuneille tukihenkilöille.\n\nIlmoitussovelluksen viestit tukevat Markdownin alajoukkoa. Lisätietoa Markdownista on sivulla [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URL-osoitteet tunnistetaan lisäksi automaattisesti ja muutetaan linkeiksi tai kuviksi, mutta voit silti halutessasi käyttää Markdownia. Markdown on käytettävissä seuraaville:\n\n* Linkit\n* Kuvat\n* Lihavointi\n* Kursiivi\n* Tason 3 otsikot\n","app.long_description":"Avainkohdat:\n\n* Ilmoita helposti tukihenkilöryhmälle tai kaikille Zendesk-tilille kirjautuneille tukihenkilöille\n* Jaa kuvia, linkkejä tai muuta hyödyllistä tai hauskaa tietoa\n* Ilmoita tukihenkilöille proaktiivisesti tärkeistä työhön liittyvistä tiedoista\n\nKuvaus:\n\nIlmoitussovelluksen avulla Zendesk-järjestelmänvalvojat voivat lähettää viestejä joillekin tai kaikille tukihenkilöille. Voit esimerkiksi tiedottaa tiimille nopeasti järjestelmän käyttökatkoista tai kutsua tiimin helposti lounaalle.  Avaa vain sovellus, kirjoita viesti, valitse ryhmä ja napsauta lähetä-painiketta. Sovellus avautuu, ja viestit tulevat esiin reaaliaikaisesti kaikille sisäänkirjautuneille tukihenkilöille.  Viestihistoria tallennetaan sovellukseen, kunnes tukihenkilöt kirjautuvat ulos Zendeskistä.\n\nIlmoita ilmoitussovelluksella yritykselle tärkeitä tietoja reaaliaikaisesti.\n\n![Esimerkki-ilmoitus](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nOttamalla tämän sovelluksen käyttöön hyväksyt Zendeskin kehittämä -käyttöehdot (https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Ilmoitussovellus","app.short_description":"Lähetä viesti kaikille tukihenkilöille, jotka ovat kirjautuneet Zendesk-tilillesi","button.cancel":"Peruuta","button.save":"Tallenna","button.sendMessage":"Lähetä","button.toAdmin":"Uusi viesti","label.groups":"Ryhmät","label.message":"Viesti","label.sender_groups":"Lähettäjäryhmät","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Tämä asetus mahdollistaa sen, että muut ryhmät voivat lähettää viestin.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Jaa viesti tukihenkilöiden kanssa. Markdown suositeltu.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Jaa viesti tukihenkilöiden kanssa. Markdownia tuetaan.","message.placeholder2":"Ei vastaanotettuja viestejä.",you2:"(sinä)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installation de l’application :\n\n1. Connectez-vous à votre compte Zendesk Support, puis cliquez sur l’icône **Admin** dans la barre latérale.\n2. Sélectionnez **Applications** > **Marketplace**, puis recherchez l’**application Notification** et cliquez sur le titre.\n3. À la page de l’application Notification, cliquez sur **Installer l’application** en haut à droite.\n4. Une fois l’installation terminée, vous pouvez diffuser des messages à vos agents connectés. \n\n**Remarque –** Seuls les administrateurs Zendesk peuvent permettre à d’autres groupes d’utilisateurs d’envoyer des notifications.\n\n### Utilisation de l’application :\n\n1. Lorsque vous êtes connecté à Zendesk, développez l’application se trouvant dans la barre supérieure. \n2. Saisissez le message que vous voulez diffuser. \n3. Sélectionnez le groupe auquel vous voulez l’envoyer (si vous ne sélectionnez aucun groupe, il sera envoyé à tous les agents connectés). \n4. Cliquez sur Diffuser. Votre message ouvrira l’application sur le poste de tous les agents connectés. \n\nLes messages de l’application Notification prennent en charge un sous-ensemble de Markdown. Pour en savoir plus sur Markdown, consultez [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Les URL sont par ailleurs automatiquement détectées et converties en liens ou images (mais vous pouvez cependant utiliser Markdown si vous le souhaitez). Markdown est compatible avec ce qui suit : \n\n* liens\n* images\n* gras\n* italique\n* titres de niveau 3\n","app.long_description":"Points-clés : \n\n* Envoyez facilement une notification à un groupe d’agents ou à tous les agents connectés à votre compte Zendesk.\n * Partagez des images, des mèmes, des liens ou autres ressources utiles ou divertissantes.\n * Communiquez proactivement aux agents des informations importantes au sujet de leur travail.\n\nDescription :\n\n l’application Notification permet aux administrateurs Zendesk de diffuser des messages à certains de vos agents ou à tous vos agents Zendesk. Par exemple, vous pouvez signaler rapidement un arrêt du système ou inviter votre équipe à déjeuner.  Il vous suffit d’ouvrir l’application, de saisir un message, de sélectionner le groupe et de cliquer sur Envoyer. L’application ouvrira et affichera les messages pour tous les agents connectés, en temps réel.  L’historique des messages est stocké dans l’application jusqu’à ce qu’ils se déconnectent de Zendesk.\n\nServez-vous de l’application Notification pour tenir toute l’entreprise au courant des informations importantes en temps réel.\n\n![Exemple de notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nEn activant cette application, vous acceptez les [Conditions d’utilisation Créées par Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Application de notifications","app.short_description":"Diffusez un message à tous les agents connectés à votre compte Zendesk","button.cancel":"Annuler","button.save":"Enregistrer","button.sendMessage":"Diffuser","button.toAdmin":"Nouveau message","label.groups":"Groupes","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Groupes de l’expéditeur","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Ce paramètre autorise d’autres groupes à envoyer un message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Partagez un message avec vos agents. Markdown conseillé.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Partagez un message avec vos agents. Markdown est pris en charge.","message.placeholder2":"Aucun message reçu",you2:"(vous)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installation de l’application :\n\n1. Connectez-vous à votre compte Zendesk Support, puis cliquez sur l’icône **Admin** dans la barre latérale.\n2. Sélectionnez **Applications** > **Marketplace**, puis recherchez l’**application Notification** et cliquez sur le titre.\n3. À la page de l’application Notification, cliquez sur **Installer l’application** en haut à droite.\n4. Une fois l’installation terminée, vous pouvez diffuser des messages à vos agents connectés. \n\n**Remarque –** Seuls les administrateurs Zendesk peuvent permettre à d’autres groupes d’utilisateurs d’envoyer des notifications.\n\n### Utilisation de l’application :\n\n1. Lorsque vous êtes connecté à Zendesk, développez l’application se trouvant dans la barre supérieure. \n2. Saisissez le message que vous voulez diffuser. \n3. Sélectionnez le groupe auquel vous voulez l’envoyer (si vous ne sélectionnez aucun groupe, il sera envoyé à tous les agents connectés). \n4. Cliquez sur Diffuser. Votre message ouvrira l’application sur le poste de tous les agents connectés. \n\nLes messages de l’application Notification prennent en charge un sous-ensemble de Markdown. Pour en savoir plus sur Markdown, consultez [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Les URL sont par ailleurs automatiquement détectées et converties en liens ou images (mais vous pouvez cependant utiliser Markdown si vous le souhaitez). Markdown est compatible avec ce qui suit : \n\n* liens\n* images\n* gras\n* italique\n* titres de niveau 3\n","app.long_description":"Points-clés : \n\n* Envoyez facilement une notification à un groupe d’agents ou à tous les agents connectés à votre compte Zendesk.\n * Partagez des images, des mèmes, des liens ou autres ressources utiles ou divertissantes.\n * Communiquez proactivement aux agents des informations importantes au sujet de leur travail.\n\nDescription :\n\n l’application Notification permet aux administrateurs Zendesk de diffuser des messages à certains de vos agents ou à tous vos agents Zendesk. Par exemple, vous pouvez signaler rapidement un arrêt du système ou inviter votre équipe à déjeuner.  Il vous suffit d’ouvrir l’application, de saisir un message, de sélectionner le groupe et de cliquer sur Envoyer. L’application ouvrira et affichera les messages pour tous les agents connectés, en temps réel.  L’historique des messages est stocké dans l’application jusqu’à ce qu’ils se déconnectent de Zendesk.\n\nServez-vous de l’application Notification pour tenir toute l’entreprise au courant des informations importantes en temps réel.\n\n![Exemple de notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nEn activant cette application, vous acceptez les [Conditions d’utilisation Créées par Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"App de notifications","app.short_description":"Diffusez un message à tous les agents connectés à votre compte Zendesk","button.cancel":"Annuler","button.save":"Enregistrer","button.sendMessage":"Diffuser","button.toAdmin":"Nouveau message","label.groups":"Groupes","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Groupes de l’expéditeur","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Ce paramètre autorise d’autres groupes à envoyer un message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Partagez un message avec vos agents. Markdown conseillé.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Partagez un message avec vos agents. Markdown est pris en charge.","message.placeholder2":"Aucun message reçu",you2:"(vous)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###התקנת האפליקציה:\n\n1. היכנס ל-Zendesk Support ולחץ על האייקון **'ניהול המערכת'** בסרגל הצידי.\n2. בחר **'אפליקציות'** > **'שוק'**, מצא את **Notification App** ולחץ על הכותרת.\n3. בדף של Notification App, לחץ על **'התקן אפליקציה'** בפינה הימנית העליונה.\n4. כשההתקנה מסתיימת אפשר לשדר הודעות לנציגים המחוברים.\n\n**שים לב:** רק מנהלי מערכת של Zendesk יכולים לאפשר לקבוצות משתמשים אחרות לקבל הרשאה לשלוח הודעות.\n\n### באמצעות האפליקציה:\n\n1. כשאתה ב-Zendesk, הרחב את האפליקציה שנמצאת בסרגל העליון.\n2. הזן את ההודעה שברצונך לשדר.\n3. בחר את הקבוצה שברצונך לשלוח אליה. אם לא תבחר קבוצה, ההודעה תישלח לכל הנציגים המחוברים.\n4. לחץ על 'שדר'. ההודעה שלך תפתח את האפליקציה אצל כל הנציגים המחוברים.\n\nההודעות ב-Notification App תומכות בחלק מהאפשרויות של Markdown. למידע נוסף על Markdown, ראה [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/]‏(http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  כתובות ה-URL מזוהות אוטומטית והופכות לקישורים או לתמונות, אבל אם תרצה, עדיין תוכל להשתמש ב-Markdown. אלה אפשרויות Markdown הנתמכות:\n\n‏* Links (קישורים)\n*Images (תמונות)\n‏* Bold (מודגש)\n‏* Italic (נטוי)\n‏* Level 3 headings (כותרות ברמה 3)\n","app.long_description":"נקודות מרכזיות:\n\n* שלח בקלות הודעות לקבוצה של נציגים או לכל הנציגים המחוברים לחשבון Zendesk\n* שתף תמונות, קישורים ומקורות מועילים או מעניינים אחרים\n* שלח לנציגים באופן יזום מידע חשוב הקשור לעבודתם\n\nתיאור:\n\nה-Notification App מאפשרת למנהלי מערכת Zendesk לשדר הודעות לחלק מהנציגים או לכולם. לדוגמה, הודע לכל הצוות על אי זמינות מתוכננת של המערכת או הזמן את כולם לצאת לאכול.  פתח את האפליקציה, הקלד הודעה, בחר את הקבוצה ולחץ על 'שלח'. האפליקציה תיפתח בזמן אמת ותציג הודעות אצל כל הנציגים המחוברים.  היסטוריית ההודעות נשמרת באפליקציה עד שהם יוצאים מ-Zendesk.\n\nהשתמש ב-Notification App כדי לדאוג לכך שכולם בארגון יהיו מיודעים בנושאים קריטיים בזמן אמת.\n\n![הודעה לדוגמה](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nבהפעלת האפליקציה אתה מסכים ל[תנאי השימוש של 'נבנה באמצעות Zendesk']‏(https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"שדר הודעה לכל הנציגים המחוברים לחשבון Zendesk שלך","button.cancel":"בטל","button.save":"שמור","button.sendMessage":"שדר","button.toAdmin":"הודעה חדשה","label.groups":"קבוצות","label.message":"הודעה","label.sender_groups":"קבוצות שולחים","label.sender_groups_helptext":"ההגדרה הזאת מאפשרת לקבוצות אחרות לשלוח הודעה.","message.messagePlaceholder":"שתף הודעה עם הנציגים. מומלץ להשתמש ב-Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"שתף הודעה עם הנציגים. יש תמיכה ב-Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"לא התקבלו הודעות.",you2:"(אתה)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### ऐप स्थापित करना:\n\n1. अपने Zendesk Support में साइन इन करें, फिर साइडबार में ** व्यवस्थापक ** आइकन पर क्लिक करें.\n2. **ऐप्स**> **मार्केटप्लेस** चुनें, फिर **सूचना ऐप** ढूंढें और शीर्षक पर क्लिक करें.\n3. सूचना ऐप पृष्ठ पर, ऊपरी-दाएं कोने में ** ऐप स्थापित करें ** पर क्लिक करें.\n4. जब स्थापना पूरी हो जाती है, तो अब आप अपने साइन-इन एजेंटों को संदेश प्रसारित कर सकते हैं.\n\n**ध्यान दें :** केवल Zendesk व्यवस्थापक ही अन्य उपयोगकर्ता समूहों को सूचना भेजने के लिए अनुमत कर सकते हैं.\n\n### ऐप का उपयोग करना:\n\n1. Zendesk में साइन इन होने पर शीर्ष बार में स्थित ऐप का विस्तार करें.\n2. वह संदेश दर्ज करें जिसे आप प्रसारित करना चाहते हैं.\n3. उस समूह का चयन करें जिसे आप इसे भेजना चाहते हैं. यदि आप समूह को खाली छोड़ देते हैं, तो यह सभी साइन-इन एजेंटों को भेजा जाएगा.\n4. प्रसारण पर क्लिक करें. आपका संदेश सभी साइन-इन एजेंटों के लिए ऐप खोल देगा.\n\nसूचना ऐप के संदेश Markdown के सबसेट का समर्थन करते हैं. Markdown के बारे में अधिक जानकारी के लिए [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/) देखें.  URL को अपने आप पहचाना जाता है और लिंक या छवियों में बदल दिया जाता है, लेकिन यदि आप चाहें तो आप अभी भी Markdown का उपयोग कर सकते हैं. Markdown निम्नलिखित के लिए समर्थित है:\n\n* लिंक\n* छवियां\n* बोल्ड\n* इटालिक\n* स्तर 3 शीर्षक\n","app.long_description":"मुख्य बिंदु:\n\n* आसानी से एजेंटों के समूह या आपके Zendesk खाते में साइन-इन सभी एजेंटों को सूचित करें\n* चित्र, लिंक या अन्य उपयोगी या मजेदार संसाधन साझा करें\n* सक्रिय रूप से एजेंटों को उनके काम के बारे में महत्वपूर्ण जानकारी बताएं\n\nविवरण:\n\nसूचना ऐप Zendesk व्यवस्थापकों को आपके कुछ या सभी एजेंटों को संदेश प्रसारित करने में सक्षम बनाता है. उदाहरण के लिए, जल्दी से अपनी टीम को बिजली जाने की सूचना दें या आसानी से टीम को दोपहर के भोजन के लिए आमंत्रित करें.  बस ऐप खोलें, एक संदेश टाइप करें, समूह का चयन करें और भेज दें. ऐप तुरंत रीयल टाइम में सभी साइन-इन एजेंटों के पास खुलेगा और संदेश प्रदर्शित करेगा.  संदेश इतिहास ऐप में तब तक संग्रहीत किया जाता है जब तक वे Zendesk से साइन आउट नहीं करते हैं.\n\n सूचना ऐप का प्रयोग कंपनी को महत्वपूर्ण जानकारी, वास्तविक समय में देने के लिए करें\n\n![सूचना उदाहरण](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nइस ऐप को सक्षम करके आप [Zendesk द्वारा निर्मित उपयोग की शर्तों](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/) से सहमति जताते हैं.","app.name":"सूचना ऐप","app.short_description":"आपके Zendesk खाते में साइन-इन सभी एजेंटों को एक संदेश प्रसारित करें.","button.cancel":"रद्द करें","button.save":"सहेजें","button.sendMessage":"प्रसारित करें","button.toAdmin":"नया संदेश","label.groups":"समूह","label.message":"संदेश","label.sender_groups":"प्रेषक समूह","label.sender_groups_helptext":"इस सेटिंग द्वारा अन्य समूहों को संदेश भेजा जा सकता है.","message.messagePlaceholder":"अपने एजेंटों के साथ संदेश साझा करें. Markdown के प्रयोग को प्रोत्साहित किया जाता है.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"अपने एजेंटों के साथ संदेश साझा करें. Markdown समर्थित है.","message.placeholder2":"कोई संदेश प्रात नहीं हुआ.",you2:"(आप)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Az alkalmazás telepítése:\n\n1. Jelentkezzen be a Zendesk Supportba, majd kattintson az oldalsávon található **Rendszergazda** ikonra.\n2. Válassza az **Alkalmazások** > **Piactér** lehetőséget, keresse meg a **Notification alkalmazást**, majd kattintson az alkalmazást jelölő téglalapra.\n3. A **Notification alkalmazás** oldalán, a jobb felső sarokban kattintson az **Alkalmazás telepítése** gombra.\n4. A telepítés befejezését követően üzeneteket küldhet szét a bejelentkezett munkatársaknak.\n\n**Megjegyzés:** Kizárólag Zendesk-rendszergazdák engedélyezhetik más felhasználói csoportoknak, hogy üzeneteket küldhessenek.\n\n### Az alkalmazás használata:\n\n1. Ha be van jelentkezve a Zendeskbe, bontsa ki az alkalmazást a felső sávon.\n2. Írja be a szétküldeni kívánt üzenetet.\n3. Válassza ki, hogy mely csoportnak szeretné elküldeni. Ha nem ad meg csoportot, akkor az üzenetet az összes bejelentkezett munkatársnak el fogja küldeni.\n4. Kattintson a Szétküldés gombra. Az üzenete ekkor minden bejelentkezett munkatársnál megnyitja az alkalmazást.\n\nA Notification alkalmazással küldött üzenetek részben támogatják a Markdown használatát. A Markdownnal kapcsolatban a [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/) címen talál további információkat. Az URL-címeket az alkalmazás automatikusan felismeri és hivatkozássá vagy képpé alakítja, de ha szeretné, használhatja a Markdownt is. A Markdown a következők esetén támogatott:\n\n* Hivatkozások\n* Képek\n* Félkövér betű\n* Dőlt betű\n* 3. szintű címsorok\n","app.long_description":"Legfontosabb jellemzők:\n\n* Egyszerűen értesítheti a Zendesk-fiókjába bejelentkezett összes munkatársat, vagy azok egy csoportját\n* Megoszthat képeket, hivatkozásokat, illetve egyéb hasznos vagy szórakoztató erőforrásokat\n* Proaktívan tájékoztathatja munkatársait a munkájukkal kapcsolatos fontos tudnivalókról.\n\nLeírás:\n\nA Notification alkalmazással a Zendesk-rendszergazdák üzeneteket küldhetnek szét bizonyos munkatársaknak, vagy akár az összesnek. Gyorsan tájékoztathatja például a csapatát egy szolgáltatás kieséséről, vagy könnyedén meghívhatja őket ebédelni. Egyszerűen csak nyissa meg az alkalmazást, írjon be egy üzenetet, válassza ki a csoportot, majd kattintson a küldés gombra. Az alkalmazás az összes bejelentkezett munkatársnál egyszerre, valós időben jeleníti meg az üzenetet egy felugró ablakban. Az üzentek előzményeit a Zendesk a kijelentkezésig tárolja.\n\nA Notification alkalmazással folyamatosan és valós időben tájékoztathatja vállalatát a kritikus információkkal kapcsolatban.\n\n![Példa egy üzenetre](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAz alkalmazás engedélyezésével elfogadja a következőket: [Készült a Zendesk által – Felhasználási feltételek](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notification alkalmazás","app.short_description":"Üzenet közvetítése a Zendesk-fiókjába bejelentkezett összes munkatársának","button.cancel":"Mégse","button.save":"Mentés","button.sendMessage":"Közvetítés","button.toAdmin":"Új üzenet","label.groups":"Csoportok","label.message":"Üzenet","label.sender_groups":"Küldőcsoportok","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Ezzel a beállítással más csoportok is küldhetnek üzeneteket.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Osszon meg egy üzenetet a munkatársaival. Bátorítjuk a Markdown használatára.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Osszon meg egy üzenetet a munkatársaival. A Markdown támogatott.","message.placeholder2":"Nincsenek beérkezett üzenetek.",you2:"(Ön)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"###Menginstal aplikasi:\n\n1. Masuk ke Zendesk Support Anda, lalu klik ikon **Admin** pada bilah samping.\n2. Pilih **Aplikasi** > **Marketplace**, lalu temukan **Aplikasi Notifikasi** dan klik judul.\n3. Pada halaman Aplikasi Notifikasi, klik **Instal aplikasi** yang ada di pojok kanan atas.\n4. Ketika instalasi selesai, Anda sekarang dapat menyiarkan pesan kepada agen Anda yang masuk ke akun.\n\n**Catatan:** Hanya administrator Zendesk yang dapat mengaktifkan grup pengguna lain agar diizinkan mengirim notifikasi.\n\n### Menggunakan aplikasi:\n\n1. Ketika masuk ke Zendesk, perluas tampilan aplikasi yang ada di batang atas.\n2. Masukkan pesan yang ingin Anda siarkan. \n3. Pilih grup yang ingin Anda kirimi. Jika Anda membiarkan grup kosong, maka akan dikirimkan ke semua agen yang sudah masuk.\n4. Klik Siarkan. Pesan Anda akan membuka aplikasi untuk semua agen yang masuk.\n\nPesan di dalam aplikasi Notifikasi mendukung subset Markdown. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut mengenai Markdown, lihat [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URL secara otomatis terdeteksi dan berubah menjadi tautan atau gambar, namun Anda masih dapat menggunakan Markdown jika menginginkannya. Markdown didukung untuk hal berikut:\n\n* Tautan\n* Gambar\n* Cetak tebal\n* Cetak miring\n* Judul level 3\n","app.long_description":"Poin penting:\n\n* Memberi tahu sekelompok agen atau semua agen yang masuk ke akun Zendesk Anda dengan mudah\n* Berbagi gambar, tautan, atau sumber daya bermanfaat atau menyenangkan lainnya\n* Secara proaktif mengabari agen mengenai informasi penting tentang pekerjaan mereka\n\nDeskripsi:\n\nAplikasi Notifikasi memungkinkan administrator Zendesk untuk menyiarkan pesan kepada beberapa atau semua agen Anda. Misalnya, memberi tahu tim Anda dengan cepat mengenai pemadaman listrik atau memudahkan untuk mengundang tim makan siang bersama.  Buka saja aplikasi, ketik pesan, pilih grup, dan klik kirim. Aplikasi akan menyembul terbuka dan menampilkan pesan kepada semua yang agen yang masuk ke akun pada waktu nyata.  Riwayat pesan disimpan dalam aplikasi sampai mereka sign out dari Zendesk.\n\nGunakan aplikasi Notifikasi agar perusahaan mengetahui informasi penting, dalam waktu nyata.\n\n![Contoh Notifikasi](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nDengan mengaktifkan aplikasi ini, Anda menyetujui [Ketentuan Penggunaan Built by Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplikasi Pemberitahuan","app.short_description":"Siarkan sebuah pesan kepada semua agen yang sudah masuk ke akun Zendesk Anda","button.cancel":"Batal","button.save":"Simpan","button.sendMessage":"Siarkan","button.toAdmin":"Pesan baru","label.groups":"Grup","label.message":"Pesan","label.sender_groups":"Grup pengirim","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Pengaturan ini mengizinkan grup lain untuk mengirim pesan.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Bagikan pesan dengan agen Anda. Markdown dianjurkan.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Bagikan pesan dengan agen Anda. Markdown didukung.","message.placeholder2":"Tidak ada pesan yang diterima.",you2:"(Anda)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installazione dell’app:\n\n1. Accedi a Zendesk Support e fai clic sull’icona **Amministratore** nella barra laterale.\n2. Seleziona **App** > **Marketplace**, quindi trova **App di notifica** e fai clic sulla tile.\n3. Nella pagina App di notifica, fai clic su **Installa app** nell’angolo in alto a destra.\n4. Completata l’installazione, puoi trasmettere messaggi agli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso.\n\n**Nota:** solo gli amministratori Zendesk possono permettere ad altri gruppi di utenti di inviare notifiche.\n\n### Uso dell’app\n\n1. Dopo avere effettuato l’accesso a Zendesk, espandi l’app nella barra superiore.\n2. Inserisci il messaggio che vuoi trasmettere.\n3. Seleziona il gruppo a cui mandarlo. Lasciando il campo vuoto, il messaggio sarà inviato a tutti gli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso.\n4. Fai clic su Trasmetti. Il messaggio apre l’app sullo schermo di tutti gli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso.\n\nPer i messaggi, l’app di notifica supporta un sottoinsieme di funzioni Markdown. Per maggiori informazioni su Markdown, visita il sito [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Gli URL vengono rilevati automaticamente e convertiti in link o immagini (ma, volendo, si può sempre usare Markdown). Il supporto di Markdown include:\n\n* Collegamenti\n* Immagini\n* Grassetto\n* Corsivo\n* Intestazioni fino al terzo livello\n","app.long_description":"Punti chiave:\n\n* Facili notifiche a un gruppo di agenti o a tutti gli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso all’account Zendesk.\n* Condivisione di immagini, link o altre risorse.\n* Comunicazione tempestiva agli agenti in merito a informazioni importanti per il loro lavoro.\n\nDescrizione:\n\nL’app di notifica permette agli amministratori Zendesk di trasmettere messaggi a tutti gli agenti, o ad alcuni di essi. Ad esempio, consente di segnalare al team una possibile interruzione di energia o di annunciare l’inizio della pausa pranzo.  Basta aprire l’app, digitare il messaggio, selezionare il gruppo di destinatari e fare clic su Trasmetti. L’app apre una finestra e visualizza in tempo reale il messaggio sullo schermo dei destinatari collegati.  La cronologia dei messaggi ricevuti da un agente rimane memorizzata nell’app finché l’agente non esce da Zendesk.\n\nL’app di notifica è utile per tenere l’azienda al corrente di informazioni cruciali in tempo reale.\n\n![Esempio di notifica](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAttivando l’app, accetti le [Condizioni di utilizzo per le app create da Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"App di notifica","app.short_description":"Trasmette un messaggio a tutti gli agenti collegati all’account Zendesk.","button.cancel":"Annulla","button.save":"Salva","button.sendMessage":"Trasmetti","button.toAdmin":"Nuovo messaggio","label.groups":"Gruppi","label.message":"Messaggio","label.sender_groups":"Gruppi di mittenti","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Questa impostazione permette ad altri gruppi di inviare messaggi.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Condividi un messaggio con gli agenti. Si consiglia l’uso di Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Condividi un messaggio con i tuoi agenti. Markdown è supportato.","message.placeholder2":"Nessun messaggio ricevuto.",you2:"(tu)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installazione dell’app:\n\n1. Accedi a Zendesk Support e fai clic sull’icona **Amministratore** nella barra laterale.\n2. Seleziona **App** > **Marketplace**, quindi trova **App di notifica** e fai clic sulla tile.\n3. Nella pagina App di notifica, fai clic su **Installa app** nell’angolo in alto a destra.\n4. Completata l’installazione, puoi trasmettere messaggi agli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso.\n\n**Nota:** solo gli amministratori Zendesk possono permettere ad altri gruppi di utenti di inviare notifiche.\n\n### Uso dell’app\n\n1. Dopo avere effettuato l’accesso a Zendesk, espandi l’app nella barra superiore.\n2. Inserisci il messaggio che vuoi trasmettere.\n3. Seleziona il gruppo a cui mandarlo. Lasciando il campo vuoto, il messaggio sarà inviato a tutti gli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso.\n4. Fai clic su Trasmetti. Il messaggio apre l’app sullo schermo di tutti gli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso.\n\nPer i messaggi, l’app di notifica supporta un sottoinsieme di funzioni Markdown. Per maggiori informazioni su Markdown, visita il sito [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Gli URL vengono rilevati automaticamente e convertiti in link o immagini (ma, volendo, si può sempre usare Markdown). Il supporto di Markdown include:\n\n* Collegamenti\n* Immagini\n* Grassetto\n* Corsivo\n* Intestazioni fino al terzo livello\n","app.long_description":"Punti chiave:\n\n* Facili notifiche a un gruppo di agenti o a tutti gli agenti che hanno effettuato l’accesso all’account Zendesk.\n* Condivisione di immagini, link o altre risorse.\n* Comunicazione tempestiva agli agenti in merito a informazioni importanti per il loro lavoro.\n\nDescrizione:\n\nL’app di notifica permette agli amministratori Zendesk di trasmettere messaggi a tutti gli agenti, o ad alcuni di essi. Ad esempio, consente di segnalare al team una possibile interruzione di energia o di annunciare l’inizio della pausa pranzo.  Basta aprire l’app, digitare il messaggio, selezionare il gruppo di destinatari e fare clic su Trasmetti. L’app apre una finestra e visualizza in tempo reale il messaggio sullo schermo dei destinatari collegati.  La cronologia dei messaggi ricevuti da un agente rimane memorizzata nell’app finché l’agente non esce da Zendesk.\n\nL’app di notifica è utile per tenere l’azienda al corrente di informazioni cruciali in tempo reale.\n\n![Esempio di notifica](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAttivando l’app, accetti le [Condizioni di utilizzo per le app create da Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"App di notifica","app.short_description":"Trasmette un messaggio a tutti gli agenti collegati all’account Zendesk.","button.cancel":"Annulla","button.save":"Salva","button.sendMessage":"Trasmetti","button.toAdmin":"Nuovo messaggio","label.groups":"Gruppi","label.message":"Messaggio","label.sender_groups":"Gruppi di mittenti","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Questa impostazione permette ad altri gruppi di inviare messaggi.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Condividi un messaggio con gli agenti. Si consiglia l’uso di Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Condividi un messaggio con i tuoi agenti. Markdown è supportato.","message.placeholder2":"Nessun messaggio ricevuto.",you2:"(tu)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### アプリのインストール:\n\n1.Zendesk Supportにサインインし、サイドバーの**管理**アイコンをクリックします。\n2.「**アプリ**」 >「**マーケットプレイス**」を選択し、「**通知アプリ**」を見つけて、タイトルをクリックします。\n3.通知アプリのページで、右上隅の「**アプリのインストール**」をクリックします。\n4.インストールが終わったら、サインインしているエージェントにメッセージを一斉送信できます。\n\n**メモ:** 他のユーザーグループに通知の送信を許可できるのはZendesk管理者だけです。\n\n### アプリの使用:\n\n1.Zendeskにサインインしたら、トップバーにあるアプリを展開します。\n2.ブロードキャストするメッセージを入力します。\n3.メッセージの送信先のグループを選択します。このグループを空白のままにすると、サインインしているエージェント全員に送信されます。\n4.「一斉送信」をクリックします。サインイン中のエージェント全員の画面に通知アプリが開き、一斉送信したメッセージが表示されます。\n\n通知アプリのメッセージでは、Markdownを一部使用できます。Markdownの詳細については、[http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/)を参照してください。 また、URLは自動的に検出されてリンクや画像に変換されますが、Markdownで記述することもできます。次の書式についてMarkdownがサポートされます:\n\n* リンク\n* 画像\n* 太字\n* 斜体\n* レベル 3 見出し\n","app.long_description":"主なポイント:\n\n* Zendeskアカウントにサインインしているエージェントのグループやエージェント全員に簡単に一斉通知\n* 画像やリンク、その他の便利なリソースや楽しいリソースを共有\n* 業務に関する重要な情報をエージェントに事前に通知\n\n説明:\n\n通知アプリを使って、Zendesk管理者はエージェントの一部または全員にメッセージを一斉送信できます。たとえば、チームに停電をすばやく通知したり、チームを簡単にランチに招待することができます。 アプリを開いてメッセージを入力し、グループを選択して「送信」をクリックするだけです。サインインしているすべてのエージェントにリアルタイムでアプリがポップアップ表示され、メッセージが表示されます。 メッセージの履歴は、エージェントがZendeskからサインアウトするまでアプリに保存されます。\n\n通知アプリを使って、重要な情報が常にリアルタイムで社内に周知されるようにしましょう。\n\n![通知サンプル](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nこのアプリを有効にすることにより、[Zendesk作成のアプリの利用規約](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)に同意したものとみなされます。","app.name":"通知アプリ","app.short_description":"Zendeskアカウントにサインインしたすべてのエージェントにメッセージを一斉送信します","button.cancel":"キャンセル","button.save":"保存","button.sendMessage":"一斉送信","button.toAdmin":"新規メッセージ","label.groups":"グループ","label.message":"メッセージ","label.sender_groups":"送信者グループ","label.sender_groups_helptext":"この設定により、他のグループがメッセージを送信できるようになります。","message.messagePlaceholder":"エージェントとメッセージを共有します。Markdownをお勧めします。","message.messagePlaceholder2":"エージェントとメッセージを共有します。Markdownがサポートされます。","message.placeholder2":"メッセージが届いていません。",you2:"(自分)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### 앱 설치:\n\n1. Zendesk Support 계정에 로그인한 다음 사이드바에 있는 **관리자** 아이콘을 클릭합니다.\n2. **앱** > **마켓플레이스**를 선택한 다음 **알림 앱**을 찾아 제목을 클릭합니다.\n3. 알림 앱 페이지에서 오른쪽 상단에 있는 **앱 설치**를 클릭합니다.\n4. 설치가 완료되면 로그인한 상담원들에게 브로드캐스트 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다.\n\n**참고:** Zendesk 관리자만이 다른 사용자 그룹이 알림을 보낼 수 있도록 설정할 수 있습니다.\n\n### 앱 사용:\n\n1. Zendesk에 로그인할 때 맨 위 표시줄에 있는 앱을 확장합니다.\n2. 브로드캐스트하려는 메시지를 입력합니다.\n3. 브로드캐스트 메시지를 보내려는 해당 그룹을 선택합니다. 그룹을 선택하지 않고 빈 칸으로 남겨두면 로그인한 모든 상담원에게 보냅니다.\n4. 브로드캐스트를 클릭합니다. 로그인한 모든 상담원에게 앱이 열리면서 메시지가 표시됩니다.\n\n알림 앱의 메시지는 마크다운 서브셋을 지원합니다. 마크다운에 대한 자세한 정보는 [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/)을 참조하세요.  URL 역시 자동으로 감지되어 링크나 이미지로 전환됩니다(원하는 경우 계속 마크다운을 사용할 수 있습니다). 다음에 대한 마크다운이 지원됩니다.\n\n* 링크\n* 이미지\n* 굵게\n* 기울임꼴\n* 레벨 3 표제\n","app.long_description":"요점:\n\n* Zendesk 계정에 로그인한 모든 상담원 또는 일부 상담원 그룹에게 쉽게 알립니다.\n* 사진, 링크 또는 기타 유용하고 재미있는 자료를 공유합니다.\n* 상담원들에게 업무에 관련된 중요한 정보를 능동적으로 알려줍니다.\n\n설명:\n\n알림 앱을 사용하면 Zendesk 관리자가 일부 또는 모든 Zendesk 상담원에게 브로드캐스트 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다. 예를 들어, 가동 중단에 대해 팀에게 신속히 알리고 팀을 점심식사에 쉽게 초대할 수 있습니다.  앱을 열고 메시지를 입력하고 그룹을 선택한 후 보내기를 클릭하면 됩니다. 앱이 열리면서 로그인한 모든 상담원에게 실시간으로 메시지가 표시됩니다.  Zendesk에서 로그아웃할 때까지 메시지 기록이 앱에 저장됩니다.\n\n알림 앱을 사용하여 회사에 중요한 정보를 실시간으로 알리세요.\n\n![알림 예](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\n이 앱을 사용 설정하면 [Zendesk에서 제공 이용 약관](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)에 동의하는 것입니다.","app.name":"알림 앱","app.short_description":"Zendesk 계정에 로그인한 모든 상담사에게 브로드캐스트 메시지를 보내세요","button.cancel":"취소","button.save":"저장","button.sendMessage":"브로드캐스트","button.toAdmin":"새 메시지","label.groups":"그룹","label.message":"메시지","label.sender_groups":"보낸 사람 그룹","label.sender_groups_helptext":"이 설정을 통해 다른 그룹이 메시지를 보낼 수 있습니다.","message.messagePlaceholder":"상담사와 메시지를 공유하세요. 마크다운을 권장합니다.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"상담사들과 메시지를 공유하세요. 마크다운이 지원됩니다.","message.placeholder2":"메시지를 받지 못했습니다.",you2:"(본인)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('["af","ar","az","be","bg","bn","bs","ca","cs","cy","da","de","el","en-001","en-150","en-US","en-au","en-ca","en-gb","en-my","en-ph","en-se","es","es-419","es-es","et","eu","fa","fa-AF","fi","fo","fr","fr-ca","ga","he","hi","hr","hu","hy","id","is","it","it-ch","ja","ka","kk","ko","ku","lt","lv","mk","ms","mt","my","nl","nl-be","no","pl","pt","pt-br","ro","ru","sk","sl","sq","sr","sr-me","sv","th","tr","uk","ur","vi","zh-cn","zh-tw"]')},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### De app installeren:\n\n1. Meld u aan bij uw Zendesk Support-account en klik op het pictogram **Admin** op de zijbalk.\n2. Selecteer **Apps** > **Marketplace**, zoek de **app Meldingen** en klik op de tegel.\n3. Klik op de pagina van de app Meldingen op **App installeren** rechtsboven.\n4. Wanneer de installatie is voltooid, kunt u berichten uitzenden naar uw aangemelde agenten.\n\n**Opmerking:** alleen Zendesk-administrators kunnen andere gebruikersgroepen inschakelen om meldingen te verzenden.\n\n### De app gebruiken:\n\n1. Vouw de app op de bovenbalk uit wanneer u bent aangemeld bij Zendesk.\n2. Geef het bericht op dat u wilt uitzenden.\n3. Selecteer de groep waarnaar u het bericht wilt verzenden. Als u de groep leeg laat, wordt het bericht naar alle aangemelde agenten verzonden.\n4. Klik op Uitzenden. Met het verzenden van uw bericht wordt de app bij alle aangemelde agenten geopend.\n\nBerichten in de app Meldingen bieden support voor een subset van Markdown. Voor meer informatie over Markdown, verwijzen we u naar [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Webadressen worden ook automatisch gedetecteerd en omgezet in koppelingen of afbeeldingen, maar u kunt gewoon Markdown gebruiken als u dat wilt. Markdown wordt ondersteund voor:\n\n* Links\n* Afbeeldingen\n* Vet\n* Cursief\n* Kopteksten van het 3e niveau\n","app.long_description":"Belangrijkste punten:\n\n* Eenvoudig een groep agenten of alle bij uw Zendesk-account aangemelde agenten informeren\n* Afbeeldingen, koppelingen of andere nuttige of leuke informatie delen\n* Agenten proactief op de hoogte brengen van belangrijke informatie voor hun werk\n\nBeschrijving:\n\nMet de app Meldingen kunnen Zendesk-administrators berichten naar enkele of al uw agenten uitzenden. Zo kunt u uw team snel laten weten dat bepaalde systemen zijn uitgevallen, of kunt u iedereen uitnodigen voor een lunch.  Open de app, typ een bericht, selecteer de groep en verzend het bericht. De app wordt direct bij alle aangemelde agenten geopend en het bericht wordt weergegeven.  De berichtgeschiedenis wordt in de app bewaard tot de agenten zich bij Zendesk afmelden.\n\nMet de app Meldingen kunt u uw bedrijf direct op de hoogte brengen van cruciale informatie.\n\n![Voorbeeld van een melding](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nDoor deze app in te schakelen, gaat u akkoord met de [Gebruiksvoorwaarden van Gemaakt door Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"app Meldingen","app.short_description":"Stuur een bericht naar alle agenten die bij uw Zendesk-account zijn aangemeld","button.cancel":"Annuleren","button.save":"Opslaan","button.sendMessage":"Uitzenden","button.toAdmin":"Nieuw bericht","label.groups":"Groepen","label.message":"Bericht","label.sender_groups":"Verzendgroepen","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Met deze instelling kunnen andere groepen een bericht verzenden.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Stuur uw agenten een bericht. Maak bij voorkeur gebruik van Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Stuur uw agenten een bericht. Markdown wordt ondersteund.","message.placeholder2":"Geen berichten ontvangen.",you2:"(u)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### De app installeren:\n\n1. Meld u aan bij uw Zendesk Support-account en klik op het pictogram **Admin** op de zijbalk.\n2. Selecteer **Apps** > **Marketplace**, zoek de **app Meldingen** en klik op de tegel.\n3. Klik op de pagina van de app Meldingen op **App installeren** rechtsboven.\n4. Wanneer de installatie is voltooid, kunt u berichten uitzenden naar uw aangemelde agenten.\n\n**Opmerking:** alleen Zendesk-administrators kunnen andere gebruikersgroepen inschakelen om meldingen te verzenden.\n\n### De app gebruiken:\n\n1. Vouw de app op de bovenbalk uit wanneer u bent aangemeld bij Zendesk.\n2. Geef het bericht op dat u wilt uitzenden.\n3. Selecteer de groep waarnaar u het bericht wilt verzenden. Als u de groep leeg laat, wordt het bericht naar alle aangemelde agenten verzonden.\n4. Klik op Uitzenden. Met het verzenden van uw bericht wordt de app bij alle aangemelde agenten geopend.\n\nBerichten in de app Meldingen bieden support voor een subset van Markdown. Voor meer informatie over Markdown, verwijzen we u naar [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Webadressen worden ook automatisch gedetecteerd en omgezet in koppelingen of afbeeldingen, maar u kunt gewoon Markdown gebruiken als u dat wilt. Markdown wordt ondersteund voor:\n\n* Links\n* Afbeeldingen\n* Vet\n* Cursief\n* Kopteksten van het 3e niveau\n","app.long_description":"Belangrijkste punten:\n\n* Eenvoudig een groep agenten of alle bij uw Zendesk-account aangemelde agenten informeren\n* Afbeeldingen, koppelingen of andere nuttige of leuke informatie delen\n* Agenten proactief op de hoogte brengen van belangrijke informatie voor hun werk\n\nBeschrijving:\n\nMet de app Meldingen kunnen Zendesk-administrators berichten naar enkele of al uw agenten uitzenden. Zo kunt u uw team snel laten weten dat bepaalde systemen zijn uitgevallen, of kunt u iedereen uitnodigen voor een lunch.  Open de app, typ een bericht, selecteer de groep en verzend het bericht. De app wordt direct bij alle aangemelde agenten geopend en het bericht wordt weergegeven.  De berichtgeschiedenis wordt in de app bewaard tot de agenten zich bij Zendesk afmelden.\n\nMet de app Meldingen kunt u uw bedrijf direct op de hoogte brengen van cruciale informatie.\n\n![Voorbeeld van een melding](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nDoor deze app in te schakelen, gaat u akkoord met de [Gebruiksvoorwaarden van Gemaakt door Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"app Meldingen","app.short_description":"Stuur een bericht naar alle agenten die bij uw Zendesk-account zijn aangemeld","button.cancel":"Annuleren","button.save":"Opslaan","button.sendMessage":"Uitzenden","button.toAdmin":"Nieuw bericht","label.groups":"Groepen","label.message":"Bericht","label.sender_groups":"Verzendgroepen","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Met deze instelling kunnen andere groepen een bericht verzenden.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Stuur uw agenten een bericht. Maak bij voorkeur gebruik van Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Stuur uw agenten een bericht. Markdown wordt ondersteund.","message.placeholder2":"Geen berichten ontvangen.",you2:"(u)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installasjon av appen:\n\n1. Logg deg inn på Zendesk Support og klikk på **Admin**-ikonet i sidefeltet.\n2. Velg *Apper** > **Markedsplass**, finn **Varsling**-appen og klikk på tittelen.\n3. Velg **Installer app** oppe til høyre på siden for Varsling-appen.\n4. Etter at installasjonen er ferdig, kan du sende meldinger til kundekonsulentene som er pålogget.\n\n**Obs!** Det er bare Zendesk-administratorer som kan gi andre brukergrupper tillatelse til å sende varslinger.\n\n### Bruk av appen:\n\n1. Etter at du har logget deg på Zendesk, utvider du appen i feltet øverst.\n2. Legg inn meldingen du vil sende til alle.\n3. Velg gruppen du vil sende meldingen til. Hvis du lar gruppefeltet stå tomt, blir den sendt til alle kundekonsulentene som er pålogget.\n4. Klikk på Send til alle. Meldingen får appen til å åpnes for alle kundekonsulentene som er pålogget.\n\nMeldingene i Varsling-appen støtter en undergruppe av Markdown. Hvis du vil ha mer informasjon om Markdown, går du til [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URL-adressene blir også registrert automatisk og gjort om til lenker eller bilder, men du kan fremdeles bruke Markdown hvis du vil. Følgende elementer har støtte for Markdown:\n\n* Lenker\n* Bilder\n* Fet\n* Kursiv\n* Nivå-3-overskrifter\n","app.long_description":"Nøkkelpunkter:\n\n* Du kan enkelt varsle en gruppe med kundekonsulenter eller alle kundekonsulenter som er logget på Zendesk-kontoen din\n* Del bilder, memer, lenker og andre nyttige eller morsomme elementer\n* Informer kundekonsulentene om viktig informasjon om arbeidet deres i forkant\n\nBeskrivelse:\n\nMed Varsling-appen kan Zendesk-administratorer sende meldinger til bare utvalgte eller alle Zendesk-kundekonsulenter. Du kan f.eks. raskt informere teamet om et tjenestebrudd, eller invitere teamet til lunsj.  Det er bare å åpne appen, skrive en melding, velge gruppen og klikke send. Appen kommer fram på skjermen og viser meldingene til alle kundekonsulentene som er pålogget.  Meldingshistorikk lagres i appen inntil de logger av Zendesk.\n\nBruk Varsling-appen til å holde bedriften informert om viktig informasjon i sanntid.\n\n![Eksempel på Varsling](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nVed å aktivere denne appen godtar du [Laget av Zendesk-brukervilkårene](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Varsling-app","app.short_description":"Send melding til alle kundekonsulenter som er logget på Zendesk-kontoen.","button.cancel":"Avbryt","button.save":"Lagre","button.sendMessage":"Send til alle","button.toAdmin":"Ny melding","label.groups":"Grupper","label.message":"Melding","label.sender_groups":"Sendergrupper","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Med denne innstillingen kan andre grupper sende en melding.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Del en melding med kundekonsulentene. Det oppmuntres til å bruke Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Del en melding med kundekonsulentene. Markdown støttes.","message.placeholder2":"Fikk ikke noen melding.",you2:"(deg)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Instalacja aplikacji:\n\n1. Zaloguj się na koncie Zendesk Support i kliknij ikonę **Administracja** w menu bocznym.\n2. Wybierz **Aplikacje** > **Marketplace**, znajdź **aplikację Powiadomienia** i kliknij kafelek.\n3. Na stronie aplikacji Powiadomienia kliknij przycisk **Zainstaluj aplikację** widoczny w prawym górnym rogu.\n4. Gdy instalacja zostanie ukończona, możesz zacząć rozgłaszać wiadomości wśród zalogowanych agentów.\n\n**Uwaga:** tylko administratorzy Zendesk mogą zezwalać innym grupom użytkowników na wysyłanie powiadomień.\n\n### Korzystanie z aplikacji:\n\n1. Gdy zalogujesz się na koncie Zendesk, rozwiń aplikację widoczną na pasku górnym.\n2. Wprowadź wiadomość, którą chcesz rozgłosić.\n3. Wybierz grupę adresatów. Jeśli zostawisz to pole puste, wiadomość zostanie wysłana do wszystkich zalogowanych agentów.\n4. Kliknij przycisk Rozgłoś. Wiadomość otworzy się w aplikacji na ekranach wszystkich zalogowanych agentów.\n\nW przypadku aplikacji Powiadomienia obsługiwany jest podzbiór znaczników Markdown. Aby uzyskać więcej informacji na temat języka Markdown, zobacz [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Ponadto adresy URL są automatycznie wykrywane i zamieniane na łącza lub obrazy (jeśli jednak wolisz, nadal możesz korzystać z języka Markdown). Język Markdown jest obsługiwany w przypadku następujących elementów:\n\n* Łącza\n* Obrazy\n* Pogrubienie\n* Kursywa\n* Nagłówki trzeciego poziomu\n","app.long_description":"Najważniejsze funkcje\n\n* Łatwe powiadamianie grupy agentów lub wszystkich agentów zalogowanych na koncie Zendesk\n* Udostępnianie zdjęć, łączy i innych przydatnych bądź zabawnych materiałów\n* Aktywne przekazywanie agentom ważnych informacji związanych z ich pracą\n\nOpis:\n\nAplikacja Powiadomienia umożliwia administratorom Zendesk rozgłaszanie wiadomości do wybranych bądź wszystkich ich agentów. Na przykład można szybko powiadomić zespół o przestoju lub łatwo zaprosić wszystkich na lunch.  Wystarczy otworzyć aplikację, napisać wiadomość, wybrać grupę i kliknąć przycisk Wyślij. Aplikacja otworzy się w czasie rzeczywistym i wyświetli wiadomość na ekranach wszystkich zalogowanych agentów.  Przechowuje też historię wiadomości do czasu, gdy agent wyloguje się z Zendesk.\n\nDzięki aplikacji Powiadomienia można rozpowszechniać ważne informacje w całej firmie w czasie rzeczywistym.\n\n![Przykładowe powiadomienie](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nWłączając tę aplikację, wyrażasz zgodę na [Warunki użytkowania dotyczące aplikacji opracowanej przez Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplikacja Powiadomienia","app.short_description":"Rozgłoś wiadomość wśród agentów zalogowanych na koncie Zendesk","button.cancel":"Anuluj","button.save":"Zapisz","button.sendMessage":"Rozgłoś","button.toAdmin":"Nowa wiadomość","label.groups":"Grupy","label.message":"Wiadomość","label.sender_groups":"Grupy nadawców","label.sender_groups_helptext":"To ustawienie umożliwia innym grupom wysyłanie wiadomości.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Udostępnij wiadomość swoim agentom. Zalecany jest język Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Udostępnij wiadomość agentom. Język Markdown jest obsługiwany.","message.placeholder2":"Nie odebrano żadnych wiadomości.",you2:"(Ty)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Instalação do aplicativo:\n\n1. Entre na sua conta do Zendesk Support e, em seguida, clique no ícone **Admin.** na barra lateral.\n2. Selecione **Aplicativos** > **Marketplace**, encontre o **aplicativo Notificação** e clique no título.\n3. Na página do aplicativo Notificação, clique em **Instalar aplicativo** no canto superior direito.\n4. Quando a instalação estiver concluída, você poderá transmitir mensagens para todos os agentes conectados.\n\n**Observação:** apenas os administradores do Zendesk podem permitir que outros grupos de usuários enviem notificações.\n\n### Uso do aplicativo:\n\n1. Entre no Zendesk e expanda o aplicativo localizado na barra superior.\n2. Insira a mensagem que você deseja transmitir.\n3. Selecione o grupo para o qual você deseja enviá-la. Se você deixar o grupo em branco, ela será enviada para todos os agentes conectados.\n4. Clique em Enviar. Sua mensagem abrirá o aplicativo para todos os agentes conectados.\n\nAs mensagens no aplicativo Notificação dão suporte a um subconjunto de Markdown. Para obter mais informações sobre o Markdown, consulte [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  As URLs são detectadas automaticamente e transformadas em links ou imagens, mas você ainda pode usar Markdown se desejar. Há suporte de Markdown para o seguinte:\n\n* Links\n* Imagens\n* Negrito\n* Itálico\n* Cabeçalhos de nível 3\n","app.long_description":"Pontos principais:\n\n* Notifique com facilidade um grupo ou todos os agentes conectados na sua conta do Zendesk\n* Compartilhe imagens, links e outros recursos úteis ou divertidos\n* Forneça proativamente informações importantes sobre o trabalho dos agentes\n\nDescrição:\n\no aplicativo Notificação permite que os administradores do Zendesk transmitam mensagens para alguns ou todos os agentes. Por exemplo, informe sua equipe sobre uma interrupção do serviço ou convide-os facilmente para um almoço.  Basta abrir o aplicativo, digitar a mensagem, selecionar o grupo e clicar em enviar. O aplicativo abrirá e exibirá as mensagens para todos os agentes conectados em tempo real.  O histórico de mensagens fica armazenado no aplicativo até eles saírem do Zendesk.\n\nUse o aplicativo Notificação para manter a empresa informada sobre notícias importantes em tempo real.\n\n![Exemplo de notificação](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAo ativar esse aplicativo, Você concorda com os [Termos de Uso do Built by Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplicativo Notificação","app.short_description":"Transmita uma mensagem para todos os agentes conectados à sua conta do Zendesk","button.cancel":"Cancelar","button.save":"Salvar","button.sendMessage":"Transmitir","button.toAdmin":"Nova mensagem","label.groups":"Grupos","label.message":"Mensagem","label.sender_groups":"Grupos remetentes","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Essa configuração permite que outros grupos enviem uma mensagem.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Compartilhe uma mensagem com seus agentes. Recomenda-se o uso de Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Compartilhe uma mensagem com seus agentes. Há suporte para Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"Nenhuma mensagem recebida.",you2:"(você)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Instalação do aplicativo:\n\n1. Entre na sua conta do Zendesk Support e, em seguida, clique no ícone **Admin.** na barra lateral.\n2. Selecione **Aplicativos** > **Marketplace**, encontre o **aplicativo Notificação** e clique no título.\n3. Na página do aplicativo Notificação, clique em **Instalar aplicativo** no canto superior direito.\n4. Quando a instalação estiver concluída, você poderá transmitir mensagens para todos os agentes conectados.\n\n**Observação:** apenas os administradores do Zendesk podem permitir que outros grupos de usuários enviem notificações.\n\n### Uso do aplicativo:\n\n1. Entre no Zendesk e expanda o aplicativo localizado na barra superior.\n2. Insira a mensagem que você deseja transmitir.\n3. Selecione o grupo para o qual você deseja enviá-la. Se você deixar o grupo em branco, ela será enviada para todos os agentes conectados.\n4. Clique em Enviar. Sua mensagem abrirá o aplicativo para todos os agentes conectados.\n\nAs mensagens no aplicativo Notificação dão suporte a um subconjunto de Markdown. Para obter mais informações sobre o Markdown, consulte [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  As URLs são detectadas automaticamente e transformadas em links ou imagens, mas você ainda pode usar Markdown se desejar. Há suporte de Markdown para o seguinte:\n\n* Links\n* Imagens\n* Negrito\n* Itálico\n* Cabeçalhos de nível 3\n","app.long_description":"Pontos principais:\n\n* Notifique com facilidade um grupo ou todos os agentes conectados na sua conta do Zendesk\n* Compartilhe imagens, links e outros recursos úteis ou divertidos\n* Forneça proativamente informações importantes sobre o trabalho dos agentes\n\nDescrição:\n\no aplicativo Notificação permite que os administradores do Zendesk transmitam mensagens para alguns ou todos os agentes. Por exemplo, informe sua equipe sobre uma interrupção do serviço ou convide-os facilmente para um almoço.  Basta abrir o aplicativo, digitar a mensagem, selecionar o grupo e clicar em enviar. O aplicativo abrirá e exibirá as mensagens para todos os agentes conectados em tempo real.  O histórico de mensagens fica armazenado no aplicativo até eles saírem do Zendesk.\n\nUse o aplicativo Notificação para manter a empresa informada sobre notícias importantes em tempo real.\n\n![Exemplo de notificação](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nAo ativar esse aplicativo, Você concorda com os [Termos de Uso do Built by Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"App Notificações","app.short_description":"Difundir uma mensagem a todos os agentes iniciados na sua conta Zendesk","button.cancel":"Cancelar","button.save":"Guardar","button.sendMessage":"Transmissão","button.toAdmin":"Nova mensagem","label.groups":"Grupos","label.message":"Mensagem","label.sender_groups":"Grupos de remetentes","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Esta definição permite que outros grupos enviem uma mensagem.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Partilhe uma mensagem com os seus agentes. O markdown é encorajado.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Partilhe uma mensagem com os seus agentes. A marcação é suportada.","message.placeholder2":"Nenhuma mensagem recebida.",you2:"(você)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Instalarea aplicației:\n\n1. Autentificați-vă în Zendesk Support, apoi faceți clic pe pictograma **Administrator** din bara laterală.\n2. Selectați **Aplicații** > **Magazin de aplicații**, apoi găsiți **aplicația Notificare** și faceți clic pe titlu.\n3. În pagina aplicației Notificare, faceți clic pe **Instalare aplicație** în colțul din dreapta-sus.\n4. La finalizarea instalării, puteți difuza mesaje către agenții autentificați.\n\n**Notă:** Numai administratorii Zendesk pot aplica permisiunea de a trimite notificări pentru alte grupuri de utilizatori.\n\n### Utilizarea aplicației:\n\n1. La autentificarea în Zendesk, extindeți aplicația amplasată în bara de sus.\n2. Introduceți mesajul pe care doriți să-l difuzați.\n3. Selectați grupul către care doriți să-l trimiteți. Dacă lăsați grupul necompletat, acesta va fi trimis către toți agenții autentificați.\n4. Faceți clic pe Difuzare. Mesajul va deschide aplicația pentru toți agenții autentificați.\n\nMesajele din aplicația Notificare acceptă un subset Markdown. Pentru mai multe informații despre Markdown, consultați [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Adresele URL sunt, de asemenea, detectate automat și transformate în link-uri sau imagini, dar puteți utiliza în continuare Markdown, dacă doriți. Markdown este acceptat pentru următoarele:\n\n* Link-uri\n* Imagini\n* Caractere aldine\n* Caractere italice\n* Antete de nivel 3\n","app.long_description":"Aspecte-cheie:\n\n* Notificați cu ușurință un grup de agenți sau toți agenții autentificați în contul dumneavoastră Zendesk\n* Partajați imagini, link-uri sau alte resurse utile sau amuzante\n* Înștiințați în mod proactiv agenții cu privire la informațiile importante legate de activitatea lor\n\nDescriere:\n\nAplicația Notificare permite administratorilor Zendesk să difuzeze mesaje către o parte sau toți agenții dumneavoastră. De exemplu, vă anunțați rapid echipa cu privire la o defecțiune sau îi invitați cu ușurință pe membrii echipei la un prânz.  Pur și simplu deschideți aplicația, tastați un mesaj, selectați grupul și faceți clic pe trimitere. Aplicația va apărea ca o fereastră pop-up și va afișa mesajele tuturor agenților autentificați, în timp real.  Istoricul mesajelor este stocat în aplicație până când agentul se deconectează din Zendesk.\n\nUtilizați aplicația Notificare pentru a ține compania la curent cu informațiile esențiale, în timp real.\n\n![Exemplu de notificare] (https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nActivând această aplicație, sunteți de acord cu [Termenii de utilizare pentru produsele desemnate prin „Conceput de Zendesk”] (https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Aplicația Notificare","app.short_description":"Difuzați un mesaj tuturor agenților autentificați în contul dumneavoastră Zendesk","button.cancel":"Anulare","button.save":"Salvare","button.sendMessage":"Difuzare","button.toAdmin":"Mesaj nou","label.groups":"Grupuri","label.message":"Mesaj","label.sender_groups":"Grupuri expeditori","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Această setare permite altor grupuri să trimită mesaje.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Partajați un mesaj cu agenții dumneavoastră. Markdown este recomandat.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Partajați un mesaj cu agenții dumneavoastră. Markdown este acceptat.","message.placeholder2":"Niciun mesaj primit.",you2:"(dumneavoastră)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Установка приложения:\n\n1. Войдите в Zendesk Support и щелкните значок **Администратор** на боковой панели.\n2. Выберите команды **Приложения ** > **Marketplace**, затем найдите приложение **Уведомление** и щелкните название.\n3. На странице приложения щелкните ссылку **Установить приложение** в правом верхнем углу.\n4. По окончании установки вы сможете транслировать сообщения своим агентам, присутствующим в системе.\n\n**Примечание.** Только администраторы Zendesk могут разрешать другим группам пользователей отправку уведомлений.\n\n### Использование приложения:\n\n1. После входа в Zendesk разверните приложение из верхнего меню.\n2. Введите сообщение, которое надо транслировать.\n3. Выберите группу, в которую оно должно быть отправлено. Если оставить поле группы пустым, сообщение будет отправлено всем агентам в системе.\n4. Нажмите кнопку «Транслировать». Ваше сообщение откроет приложение у всех агентов в системе.\n\nСообщения в приложении «Уведомление» поддерживают подмножество языка Markdown. Дополнительную информацию о Markdown можно получить здесь: [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Кроме того, URL-адреса автоматически распознаются и преобразуются в ссылки или изображения (но при желании можно использовать Markdown). Markdown поддерживается для следующих объектов:\n\n* ссылок\n* изображений\n* жирного шрифта\n* курсива\n* заголовков уровня 3\n","app.long_description":"Основные возможности:\n\n* удобное уведомление группы агентов или всех агентов, вошедших в ваш аккаунт Zendesk;\n* обмен изображениями, ссылками и другими интересными или забавными ресурсами;\n* заблаговременное доведение до агентов важной информации об их работе.\n\nОписание.\n\nПриложение «Уведомление» позволяет администраторам Zendesk транслировать сообщения некоторым или всем агентам. Например, с его помощью можно быстро известить своих сотрудников об отключении электричества или пригласить их на обед.  Просто откройте приложение, введите сообщение, выберите группу и нажмите кнопку «Отправить». Сообщение появится в реальном времени во всплывающем окне у всех агентов, которые присутствуют в системе.  История сообщений хранится в приложении, пока пользователь не выйдет из Zendesk.\n\nПриложение «Уведомление» позволяет всегда держать своих сотрудников в курсе всех событий.\n\n![Пример уведомления](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nАктивируя это приложение, вы принимаете [Условия пользования продуктами Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Приложение для уведомлений","app.short_description":"Распространяйте сообщения среди всех агентов, которые вошли в ваш аккаунт Zendesk","button.cancel":"Отмена","button.save":"Сохранить","button.sendMessage":"Распространить","button.toAdmin":"Новое сообщение","label.groups":"Группы","label.message":"Сообщение","label.sender_groups":"Группы-отправители","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Эта настройка позволяет отправлять сообщения из других групп.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Распространите сообщение среди ваших агентов. Рекомендуется применять Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Распространите сообщение среди ваших агентов. Поддерживается Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"Нет сообщений.",you2:"(вы)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Aplikácia Upozornenia","app.short_description":"Poslať správu všetkým agentom prihláseným do vášho účtu platformy Zendesk","button.cancel":"Zrušiť","button.save":"Uložiť","button.sendMessage":"Vysielať","button.toAdmin":"Nová správa","label.groups":"Skupiny","label.message":"Správa","label.sender_groups":"Skupiny odosielateľov","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Toto nastavenie umožňuje ostatným skupinám posielať správu.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Zdieľajte správu so svojimi agentmi. Odporúča sa používať syntax Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Zdieľajte správu so svojimi agentmi. Syntax Markdown je podporovaná.","message.placeholder2":"Žiadne prijaté správy.",you2:"(vy)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Så här installerar du appen:\n\n1. Logga in till Zendesk Support och klicka sedan på **administratörsikonen** på sidopanelen.\n2. Välj **Appar** > **Marknad** och sök sedan efter appen **Notifieringar** och klicka på dess bricka.\n3. Klicka på **Installera app** i det övre högra hörnet på appsidan Notifieringar.\n4. När installationen är klar kan du skicka meddelanden till dina inloggade agenter.\n\n**Obs!** Endast Zendesk-administratörer kan ge andra användargrupper behörighet att skicka notifieringar.\n\n### Så här använder du appen:\n\n1. Utöka appen på det översta fältet när du är inloggad på Zendesk.\n2. Skriv det meddelande du vill skicka.\n3. Markera den grupp du vill skicka det till. Om du inte markerar något skickas meddelandet till alla inloggade agenter.\n4. Klicka på Skicka. Ditt meddelande öppnar appen för alla inloggade agenter.\n\nMeddelanden i appen Notifieringar har stöd för en underordnad del av Markdown. Det finns mer information om Markdown på [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  Webbadresser identifieras automatiskt och görs om till länkar eller bilder (men du kan fortfarande använda Markdown om du vill). Markdown stöds för följande:\n\n* länkar\n* bilder\n* fetstil\n* kursiv stil\n* rubriker på nivå 3\n","app.long_description":"Viktiga punkter:\n\n* Skicka meddelanden till en agentgrupp eller till alla agenter som är inloggade på ditt Zendesk-konto\n* Dela bilder, länkar eller andra praktiska eller intressanta resurser\n* Underrätta agenter proaktivt om viktig information om deras arbete\n\nBeskrivning:\n\nAppen Notifieringar ger Zendesk-administratörer möjlighet att skicka meddelanden till vissa eller samtliga av dina agenter. Du kan exempelvis snabbt informera ditt team om ett strömavbrott eller enkelt bjuda in ditt team till lunch.  Allt du behöver göra är att öppna appen, skriva ett meddelande, välja en grupp och skicka. Appen öppnas i realtid och visar meddelanden för alla inloggade agenter.  Meddelandehistoriken sparas i appen tills agenten har loggat ut ur Zendesk.\n\nAnvänd appen Notifieringar för att hålla företaget underrättat med viktig information i realtid.\n\n![Exempel](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nNär du aktiverar denna app innebär det att du samtycker till [användningsvillkoren för Built by Zendesk](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Notifieringar","app.short_description":"Skicka ett meddelande till alla agenter som är inloggade på ditt Zendesk-konto","button.cancel":"Avbryt","button.save":"Spara","button.sendMessage":"Skicka ut","button.toAdmin":"Nytt meddelande","label.groups":"Grupper","label.message":"Meddelande","label.sender_groups":"Avsändargrupper","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Denna inställning ger andra grupper möjlighet att skicka ett meddelande.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Dela ett meddelande med dina agenter. Markdown rekommenderas.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Dela ett meddelande med dina agenter. Markdown stöds.","message.placeholder2":"Inga meddelanden mottagna.",you2:"(du)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### การติดตั้งแอป: \n \n 1. ลงชื่อเข้าสู่ระบบ Zendesk Support จากนั้นคลิกไอคอน ** Admin ** ในแถบด้านข้าง\n2. เลือก ** แอป ** > ** Zendesk Marketplace ** จากนั้นให้ค้นหา ** แอปการแจ้งเตือน ** และคลิกที่ชื่อ\n3. ในหน้าแอปการแจ้งเตือนให้คลิก ** ติดตั้งแอป ** ที่มุมบนขวา\n4. เมื่อการติดตั้งเสร็จสมบูรณ์ คุณสามารถออกอากาศข้อความไปยังตัวแทนที่ลงชื่อเข้าสู่ระบบของคุณได้แล้ว \n\n ** หมายเหตุ: ** เฉพาะผู้ดูแลระบบ Zendesk สามารถอนุญาตให้กลุ่มผู้ใช้อื่นสามารถส่งการแจ้งเตือนได้ \n\n ### การใช้แอป: \n\n1. เมื่อลงชื่อเข้าใช้ Zendesk ให้ขยายแอปที่อยู่ในแถบด้านบน \n 2 กรอกข้อความที่คุณอยากจะกระจาย \n3. เลือกกลุ่มที่คุณต้องการส่ง ถ้าคุณปล่อยให้กลุ่มว่างไว้ ระบบจะส่งไปให้เจ้าหน้าที่ที่ลงชื่อเข้าใช้ทั้งหมด \n 4. คลิก กระจาย ข้อความของคุณจะเปิดแอปสำหรับเจ้าหน้าที่ที่ลงชื่อเข้าใช้แล้วทั้งหมด \n\n ข้อความในแอปพลิเคชันการแจ้งเตือนสนับสนุนชุดย่อยของ Markdown สำหรับข้อมูลเพิ่มเติมเกี่ยวกับ Markdown โปรดดูที่ [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/)  ระบบจะตรวจพบ URL โดยอัตโนมัติและเปลี่ยนเป็นลิงก์หรือรูปภาพ แต่คุณยังคงสามารถใช้ Markdown ได้หากต้องการ Markdown ได้รับการสนับสนุนสำหรับ: \n \n * ลิงก์ \n * รูปภาพ \n * Bold \n * Italic \n * หัวเรื่องระดับ 3 \n","app.long_description":"จุดสำคัญ: \n \n * แจ้งกลุ่มเจ้าหน้าที่หรือเจ้าหน้าที่ทั้งหมดเข้าสู่บัญชี Zendesk ของคุณได้อย่างง่ายดาย \n * แชร์ภาพลิงก์หรือทรัพยากรที่มีประโยชน์หรือสนุกสนานอื่นๆ \n * ให้ตัวแทนรู้ข้อมูลสำคัญอย่างรอบคอบเกี่ยวกับงานของพวกเขา \n \n คำอธิบาย: \n \n แอปการแจ้งเตือนช่วยให้ผู้ดูแลระบบ Zendesk สามารถแพร่ภาพข้อความไปยังเจ้าหน้าที่บางส่วนหรือทั้งหมดของคุณได้ ตัวอย่างเช่น แจ้งให้ทีมของคุณทราบเกี่ยวกับการหยุดทำงานหรือชวนพวกเขาทานมื้อกลางวันได้อย่างรวดเร็ว  เพียงเปิดแอปพิมพ์ข้อความเลือกกลุ่มแล้วคลิกส่ง แอปจะเปิดและแสดงข้อความไปยังเจ้าหน้าที่ที่ลงชื่อเข้าสู่ระบบทั้งหมดในแบบเรียลไทม์  ประวัติข้อความจะเก็บไว้ในแอปพลิเคชันจนกว่าจะลงชื่อออกจาก Zendesk \n \n ใช้แอปการแจ้งเตือนเพื่อให้บริษัททราบข้อมูลสำคัญในแบบเรียลไทม์ \n \n! [ตัวอย่างการแจ้งเตือน] (https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif) \n \n ด้วยการเปิดใช้งานแอปนี้คุณยอมรับ [เงื่อนไขการให้บริการของ Built by Zendesk] (https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)","app.name":"แอปการแจ้งเตือน","app.short_description":"ออกอากาศข้อความไปยังเจ้าหน้าที่ทั้งหมดที่ลงชื่อเข้าสู่ระบบบัญชี Zendesk ของคุณ","button.cancel":"ยกเลิก","button.save":"บันทึก","button.sendMessage":"ออกอากาศ","button.toAdmin":"ข้อความใหม่","label.groups":"กลุ่ม","label.message":"ข้อความ","label.sender_groups":"กลุ่มผู้ส่ง","label.sender_groups_helptext":"การตั้งค่านี้ช่วยให้กลุ่มอื่นสามารถส่งข้อความได้","message.messagePlaceholder":"แชร์ข้อความกับเจ้าหน้าที่ของคุณ แนะนำให้ทำเครื่องหมาย","message.messagePlaceholder2":"แชร์ข้อความกับเจ้าหน้าที่ของคุณ รองรับ Markdown","message.placeholder2":"ยังไม่มีข้อความที่ได้รับ",you2:"(คุณ)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Uygulama kurulumu:\n\n1. Zendesk Support’ta oturum açın ve yan çubuktaki **Yönetici** simgesine tıklayın.\n2. **Uygulamalar** > **Market**'i seçin ve **Bildirim uygulamasını** bulup kutucuğa tıklayın.\n3. Bildirim uygulama sayfasında sağ üst köşedeki **Uygulamayı kur** düğmesine tıklayın.\n4. Kurulum tamamlandıktan sonra, oturum açmış temsilcilerinize mesajlarınızı yayınlayabilirsiniz.\n\n**Not:** Bildirim gönderme izni olan diğer kullanıcı gruplarını yalnızca Zendesk yöneticileri etkinleştirebilir.\n\n### Uygulamayı kullanma:\n\n1. Zendesk'te oturum açıp üst çubuktaki uygulamayı genişletin.\n2. Yayınlamak istediğiniz mesajı girin.\n3. Mesajı göndermek istediğiniz grubu seçin. Grubu boş bırakırsanız mesaj oturum açmış temsilcilerin tümüne gönderilir.\n4. Yayınla'ya tıklayın. Mesajınız oturum açmış temsilcilerin tümü için açılır.\n\nBildirim uygulamasındaki mesajlar Markdown'ın bir alt kümesini destekler. Markdown hakkında daha fazla bilgi edinmek için [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/) adresine bakın.  URL'ler de otomatik olarak algılanıp bağlantılara veya resimlere dönüştürülür ama isterseniz Markdown'ı kullanmaya devam edebilirsiniz. Markdown şu öğelerde desteklenmektedir:\n\n* Bağlantılar\n* Resimler\n* Kalın\n* İtalik\n* Düzey 3 başlıklar\n","app.long_description":"Önemli noktalar:\n\n* Zendesk hesabında oturum açmış bir grup temsilciye veya tüm temsilcilere kolaylıkla bildirim gönderin\n* Resim, bağlantı vb. yararlı veya eğlenceli kaynaklar paylaşın\n* Temsilcilerin işleriyle ilgili önemli bilgileri öğrenmelerini proaktif bir şekilde sağlayın\n\nAçıklama:\n\nBildirim uygulaması sayesinde Zendesk yöneticileri temsilcilerinizin bir kısmına veya tümüne mesajlar yayınlayabilir. Örneğin ekibinize bir hizmet kesintisini hızlı bir şekilde bildirebilir veya ekibi kolaylıkla yemeğe davet edebilirsiniz.  Tek yapmanız gereken, uygulamayı açıp bir mesaj yazmak, grubu seçmek ve Gönder'e tıklamak. Uygulama açılır ve oturum açmış temsilcilerin tümüne gerçek zamanlı olarak mesajları görüntüler.  Temsilciler Zendesk'te oturumlarını kapatana kadar Mesaj geçmişi uygulamada tutulur.\n\nŞirkete kritik bilgileri gerçek zamanlı iletmek için Bildirim uygulamasını kullanın.\n\n![Örnek Bildirim](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBu uygulamayı etkinleştirerek, [Built by Zendesk Kullanım Koşulları](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)'nı kabul edersiniz.","app.name":"Bildirim Uygulaması","app.short_description":"Zendesk hesabınızda oturum açmış tüm temsilcilere bir mesaj yayınlayın","button.cancel":"İptal","button.save":"Kaydet","button.sendMessage":"Yayınla","button.toAdmin":"Yeni mesaj","label.groups":"Gruplar","label.message":"Mesaj","label.sender_groups":"Gönderen grupları","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Bu ayar, diğer grupların mesaj göndermesine izin verir.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Temsilcilerinizle bir mesaj paylaşın. Markdown kullanımı tavsiye edilir.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Temsilcilerinizle bir mesaj paylaşın. Markdown destekleniyor.","message.placeholder2":"Hiç mesaj alınmadı.",you2:"(siz)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Програма сповіщень","app.short_description":"Надішліть повідомлення всім агентам, які увійшли у ваш обліковий запис Zendesk","button.cancel":"Скасувати","button.save":"Зберегти","button.sendMessage":"Трансляція","button.toAdmin":"Нове повідомлення","label.groups":"Групи","label.message":"Повідомлення","label.sender_groups":"Групи відправників","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Цей параметр дозволяє іншим групам надсилати повідомлення.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Поділіться повідомленням зі своїми агентами. Рекомендується використовувати Markdown.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Поділіться повідомленням зі своїми агентами. Підтримується Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"Повідомлень не отримано.",you2:"(ви)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Installing the app:\n\n1. Sign in to your Zendesk Support, then click the **Admin** icon in the sidebar.\n2. Select **Apps** > **Marketplace**, then find the **Notification app** and click the title.\n3. On the Notification app page, click **Install app** in the upper-right corner.\n4. When the installation is complete, you can now broadcast messages to your signed-in agents.\n\n**Note:** Only Zendesk administrators can enable other user groups to be allowed to send notifications.\n\n### Using the app:\n\n1. When signed in to Zendesk, expand the app located in the top bar.\n2. Enter the message you want to broadcast.\n3. Select the group you want to send it to. If you leave the group blank, it will be sent to all signed-in agents.\n4. Click Broadcast. Your message will open the app for all signed-in agents.\n\nMessages in the Notification app support a subset of Markdown. For more information about Markdown, see [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URLs are also automatically detected and turned into links or images, but you can still use Markdown if you'd like. Markdown is supported for the following:\n\n* Links\n* Images\n* Bold\n* Italic\n* Level 3 headings","app.long_description":'Key points:\n\n* Notify a group of agents or all the agents signed into your Zendesk account\n* Share pictures, links, or other useful or fun resources\n* Proactively let agents know important information about their work\n\nDescription:\n\nThe Notification app enables Zendesk administrators to broadcast messages to some or all of your agents. For example, quickly let your team know about an outage or easily invite the team out to lunch. Simply open the app, type a message, select the group, and click send. The app will pop open and display messages to all signed-in agents in real time. Message history is stored in the app until they sign out of Zendesk.\n\nUse the Notification app to keep the company apprised of critical information, real-time.\n\n![Example Notification](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBy enabling this app, You agree to the [Built by Zendesk Terms of Use](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)."',"app.name":"Notification App","app.short_description":"Broadcast a message to all the agents signed in to your Zendesk account","button.cancel":"Cancel","button.save":"Save","button.sendMessage":"Broadcast","button.toAdmin":"New message","label.groups":"Groups","label.message":"Message","label.sender_groups":"Sender groups","label.sender_groups_helptext":"This setting allows other groups to send a message.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is encouraged.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Share a message with your agents. Markdown is supported.","message.placeholder2":"No messages received.",you2:"(you)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### Cài đặt ứng dụng:\n\n1. Đăng nhập vào Zendesk Support, sau đó nhấp vào biểu tượng **Quản trị viên** trong thanh bên.\n2. Chọn **Ứng dụng** > **Marketplace**, sau đó tìm **Ứng dụng Thông báo** và nhấp vào tiêu đề.\n3. Trên trang ứng dụng Thông báo, nhấp vào **Cài đặt ứng dụng** ở góc trên bên phải.\n4. Khi quá trình cài đặt hoàn tất, bạn có thể phát tin nhắn tới các nhân viên hỗ trợ đã đăng nhập.\n\n**Lưu ý:** Chỉ quản trị viên Zendesk mới có thể bật tính năng cho phép các nhóm người dùng khác gửi thông báo.\n\n### Sử dụng ứng dụng:\n\n1. Khi đăng nhập vào Zendesk, hãy mở rộng ứng dụng nằm ở thanh trên cùng.\n2. Nhập tin nhắn bạn muốn phát.\n3. Chọn nhóm bạn muốn gửi tin nhắn. Nếu bạn để trống nhóm, tin nhắn sẽ được gửi tới tất cả nhân viên hỗ trợ đang đăng nhập.\n4. Nhấp vào Phát. Tin nhắn của bạn sẽ mở ứng dụng cho tất cả nhân viên hỗ trợ đang đăng nhập.\n\nTin nhắn trong ứng dụng Thông báo hỗ trợ một nhóm nhỏ Markdown. Để biết thêm thông tin về Markdown, hãy xem [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/).  URL cũng được phát hiện tự động và chuyển thành liên kết hoặc hình ảnh nhưng bạn vẫn có thể sử dụng Markdown nếu muốn. Markdown được hỗ trợ cho các thành phần sau đây:\n\n* Liên kết\n* Hình ảnh\n* In đậm\n* In nghiêng\n* Tiêu đề cấp 3\n","app.long_description":"Các điểm chính:\n\n* Dễ dàng thông báo cho một nhóm nhân viên hỗ trợ hoặc tất cả các nhân viên hỗ trợ đã đăng nhập vào tài khoản Zendesk của bạn\n* Chia sẻ hình ảnh, liên kết hoặc các tài nguyên hữu ích hoặc thú vị khác\n* Chủ động cho phép các nhân viên hỗ trợ biết thông tin quan trọng về công việc của họ\n\nMô tả:\n\nỨng dụng Thông báo cho phép quản trị viên Zendesk phát tin nhắn đến một số hoặc tất cả các nhân viên hỗ trợ của bạn. Ví dụ: nhanh chóng báo cho nhóm của bạn biết về sự cố ngừng hoạt động hoặc dễ dàng mời nhóm ra ngoài ăn trưa.  Chỉ cần mở ứng dụng, nhập tin nhắn, chọn nhóm và nhấp gửi. Ứng dụng sẽ bật mở và hiển thị tin nhắn cho tất cả các nhân viên hỗ trợ đã đăng nhập trong thời gian thực.  Lịch sử tin nhắn được lưu trữ trong ứng dụng cho đến khi họ đăng xuất khỏi Zendesk.\n\nSử dụng ứng dụng Thông báo để công ty luôn được thông báo về các thông tin quan trọng, theo thời gian thực.\n\n![Thông báo mẫu](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\nBằng việc bật ứng dụng này, bạn đồng ý với [Điều khoản sử dụng được lập bởi Zendesk] (https: //www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/).","app.name":"Ứng dụng Thông báo","app.short_description":"Phát tin nhắn tới tất cả các nhân viên hỗ trợ đã đăng nhập vào tài khoản Zendesk của bạn","button.cancel":"Hủy bỏ","button.save":"Lưu","button.sendMessage":"Phát","button.toAdmin":"Tin nhắn mới","label.groups":"Nhóm","label.message":"Tin nhắn","label.sender_groups":"Nhóm người gửi","label.sender_groups_helptext":"Cài đặt này cho phép các nhóm khác gửi tin nhắn.","message.messagePlaceholder":"Chia sẻ tin nhắn với nhân viên hỗ trợ của bạn. Markdown được khuyến khích.","message.messagePlaceholder2":"Chia sẻ tin nhắn với nhân viên hỗ trợ của bạn. Có hỗ trợ Markdown.","message.placeholder2":"Không nhận được tin nhắn nào.",you2:"(bạn)"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### 安装应用：\n\n1.登录您的 Zendesk Support，然后单击侧栏中的**管理员**图标。\n2.选择 **应用** > **市场**，然后查找**通知应用**，再单击标题。\n3.在通知应用页面上，单击右上角的**安装应用**。\n4.当安装完成后，您即可广播消息给您的已登录专员。\n\n**注释：**只有 Zendesk 管理员可以允许其它用户组发送通知。\n\n### 使用应用：\n\n1.登录 Zendesk 后，展开位于顶栏中的应用。\n2.输入您要广播的消息。\n3.选择您要发送的组。如果留空，则发送给所有已登录专员。\n4.单击“广播”。您的消息将会打开所有已登录专员的应用。\n\n通知应用中的消息支持 Markdown 子集。如需更多关于 Markdown 的信息，请参阅 [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/)。 还会自动检测 URL，并将其转为链接或图像（但是如果您希望的话，仍可使用 Markdown）。以下支持 Markdown：\n\n* 链接\n* 图像\n* 加粗\n* 倾斜\n* 3 级标题\n","app.long_description":"重点：\n\n* 方便地通知已登录您 Zendesk 帐户的专员组或所有专员\n* 共享图片、链接或其它有用或有趣的资源\n* 积极主动地把与工作相关的重要信息告诉专员\n\n描述：\n\n通知应用使 Zendesk 管理员可广播消息给您的某些或所有专员。例如，快速通知团队发生的故障，或方便地邀请团队外出午餐。 只要打开应用，输入一条消息，选择组，再单击发送即可。该应用会打开，并实时向所有的已登录专员显示消息。 消息记录储存在应用中，直至专员退出 Zendesk。\n\n使用通知应用使整个公司实时了解到重要的信息。\n\n![通知范例](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\n启用此应用即表示您同意 [Zendesk 自建使用条款](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)。","app.name":"通知应用","app.short_description":"向所有登录到您 Zendesk 帐户的专员发送一条消息","button.cancel":"取消","button.save":"保存","button.sendMessage":"广播","button.toAdmin":"新建消息","label.groups":"组","label.message":"消息","label.sender_groups":"发送人组","label.sender_groups_helptext":"此设置使其它组可发送一条消息。","message.messagePlaceholder":"与专员共享消息。建议使用 Markdown。","message.messagePlaceholder2":"与专员共享消息。支持 Markdown。","message.placeholder2":"未收到消息。",you2:"（您）"}},function(e,n){e.exports={"app.installation_instructions":"### 安裝 app：\n\n1.登入 Zendesk Support，再按一下側欄中的**管理員**圖示。\n2.選取 **App** > **Marketplace**，再尋找**通知 app** 並按一下該圖磚。\n3.在通知 app 頁面上，按一下右上角的**安裝 App**。\n4.安裝完成後，您就可廣播訊息給您的已登入代理。\n\n**備註：**僅限 Zendesk 管理員可授權允許其他使用者小組傳送通知。\n\n### 使用 app：\n\n1.登入 Zendesk 後，展開頂列中的 app。\n2.輸入您要廣播的訊息。\n3.選取您要傳送的小組。若留空則傳送至所有已登入代理。\n4.按一下「廣播」。您的訊息將開啟所有已登入代理的 app。\n\n通知 app 中的訊息支援 Markdown 子集。如需更多關於 Markdown 的資訊，請參閱 [http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/)。 另自動偵測 URL 並轉為連結或影像，但您仍可按您的偏好使用 Markdown。以下各項均支援 Markdown：\n\n* 連結\n* 影像\n* 粗體\n* 斜體\n* 第 3 階層的標題\n","app.long_description":"重點：\n\n* 便捷通知已登入您的 Zendesk 帳戶的代理小組或所有代理\n* 分享圖片、連結或其他有用或有趣的資源\n* 主動告知代理工作相關的重要資訊\n\n描述：\n\n通知 app 使 Zendesk 管理員可將訊息廣播至您的某些或所有代理。例如，將中斷資訊快速告知團隊，或便捷邀請團隊外出午餐。 您只需開啟 app，輸入一條訊息，選取小組，按一下傳送即可。將會開啟 app，向所有已登入代理顯示即時訊息。 訊息紀錄儲存在 app 中，直至代理登出 Zendesk。\n\n使用通知 app 將關鍵資訊即時告知公司。\n\n![通知樣本](https://zen-marketing-documentation.s3.amazonaws.com/docs/en/notification_app.gif)\n\n啟用此 app 即表示您同意 [Zendesk 自建使用條款](https://www.zendesk.com/company/built-by-zendesk-agmt/)。","app.name":"通知 App","app.short_description":"傳送一則訊息至所有登入您 Zendesk 帳戶的代理","button.cancel":"取消","button.save":"儲存","button.sendMessage":"廣播","button.toAdmin":"新建訊息","label.groups":"小組","label.message":"訊息","label.sender_groups":"傳送者小組","label.sender_groups_helptext":"此設定值使其他小組可傳送訊息。","message.messagePlaceholder":"與您的代理分享訊息。建議使用 Markdown。","message.messagePlaceholder2":"與您的代理分享訊息。支援 Markdown。","message.placeholder2":"未收到訊息。",you2:"（您）"}},function(e,n,t){var a=t(6)(t(2),"Map");e.exports=a},function(e,n,t){var a=t(171),o=t(178),s=t(180),i=t(181),r=t(182);function l(e){var n=-1,t=null==e?0:e.length;for(this.clear();++n<t;){var a=e[n];this.set(a[0],a[1])}}l.prototype.clear=a,l.prototype.delete=o,l.prototype.get=s,l.prototype.has=i,l.prototype.set=r,e.exports=l},function(e,n){e.exports=function(e){return"number"==typeof e&&e>-1&&e%1==0&&e<=9007199254740991}}